#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:50 of
msgid ""
"glob 显式优先：``tools:`` 装配层展开 glob 时，与已显式声明条目 规范名相同的同一资源跳过；只有不同资源得到同一 alias "
"时，才按 上一条报 ``EntryNameConflictError``。"
msgstr ""
"Glob explicit priority: when the ``tools:`` assembly layer expands globs, the same resource whose "
"canonical name matches an already explicitly declared entry is skipped; only when different "
"resources get the same alias is ``EntryNameConflictError`` raised as per the previous rule."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:53 of
msgid ""
"body 判别（本方法体内，单点维护）：键集固定为 ``description`` / ``args`` / ``output`` / "
"``enabled``；未知键 → :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` （含旧 ``inject`` 键——已"
" 删除，注入写 args 里的注入表达式）。各键去向："
msgstr ""
"body discrimination (maintained at a single point inside this method): the key set is fixed as "
"``description`` / ``args`` / ``output`` / ``enabled``; unknown keys → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` (including the old ``inject`` key — deleted; injections are "
"written as injection expressions inside args). Where each key goes:"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:58 of
msgid ""
"``description`` → ``override_description``；``str`` 构造时包装 为 "
":class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable` 常量，``Parsable`` 原样 透传，``_`` （PENDING）→"
" 空补丁（视为无覆写）；"
msgstr ""
"``description`` → ``override_description``; a ``str`` is wrapped into a "
":class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable` constant at construction, a ``Parsable`` is passed through "
"as-is, ``_`` (PENDING) → empty patch (treated as no override);"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:61 of
msgid ""
"``args`` → 逐参数判别：dict 值 → ``override_params`` 稀疏补丁 （JSON Schema 关键字）；键含 "
"``as`` → ``param_aliases``； ``_`` → 空补丁；其它值 → ``specified`` （包装 "
"``Parsable``， 惰性求值；注入表达式在此落入）；"
msgstr ""
"``args`` → per-parameter discrimination: dict values → sparse patches for ``override_params`` "
"(JSON Schema keywords); keys containing ``as`` → ``param_aliases``; ``_`` → empty patch; other "
"values → ``specified`` (wrapped in ``Parsable``, lazily evaluated; injection expressions land here);"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:65 of
msgid ""
"``output`` → 独立判别分支：值是「字段名 → JSON Schema 定义」 映射，逐字段并入 "
"``override_params``，不经过 args 的关键字 校验（``type`` 等键在此合法）；「省略字段 = 移除」语义见 "
"``FinishTool`` 规约；"
msgstr ""
"``output`` → an independent discrimination branch: the value is a 'field name → JSON Schema "
"definition' mapping, merged field by field into ``override_params`` without going through the "
"args keyword validation (keys like ``type`` are legal here); for the 'omitted field = removal' "
"semantics see the ``FinishTool`` spec;"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:56 flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:69 of
msgid "``enabled`` → 布尔原样。"
msgstr "``enabled`` → boolean as-is."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:70 of
msgid ""
"深层块（``$tools.<alias>.args.<param>.description:``）的填回先于 本方法调用（装配层时序约束：先 "
"merge 具名块，再逐条目调本方法） ——本方法看到的 ``body`` 是已合并的最终形态。"
msgstr ""
"The fill-back of deep blocks (``$tools.<alias>.args.<param>.description:``) happens before this "
"method is called (assembly-layer ordering constraint: merge named blocks first, then call this "
"method entry by entry) — the ``body`` this method sees is the merged final form."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:73 of
msgid ""
"执行时按 ``name_ori`` 现场查注册表，entry 不持有 Tool 实例引用； 不写持久化状态（entry 表由声明 / "
"``setup()`` 重建，不落盘）。"
msgstr ""
"At execution time the registry is looked up on the spot by ``name_ori``; the entry holds no Tool "
"instance reference; no persistent state is written (the entry table is rebuilt from declarations / "
"``setup()``, never persisted)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:75 of
msgid ""
"边缘情况：``name`` / ``ref.raw`` 未注册 → 经 :meth:`get_tool` （携带本 Agent 的 "
"``source_dir``）先走定向文件查找链惰性解析 ——文件覆盖 ``default::`` / "
"``builtin::``；查找链仍不命中才抛 :class:`flowing.errors.ToolNotFoundError`。"
msgstr ""
"Edge case: ``name`` / ``ref.raw`` not registered → lazily resolved via :meth:`get_tool` (carrying "
"this Agent's ``source_dir``) through the targeted file lookup chain first — files override "
"``default::`` / ``builtin::``; :class:`flowing.errors.ToolNotFoundError` is raised only when the "
"lookup chain still misses."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:80 of
msgid ""
"规范名 / 路径 / ``ns::name`` 引用串，或 ``.fya`` 解析 产出的 ``EntryRef`` （此时 ``alias`` "
"/ ``body`` 必须缺省）。"
msgstr ""
"A canonical name / path / ``ns::name`` reference string, or an ``EntryRef`` produced by ``.fya`` "
"parsing (in which case ``alias`` / ``body`` must be omitted)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:82 of
msgid "LLM 看到的别名；缺省按 ``normalize_entries`` 推断。"
msgstr "The alias seen by the LLM; when omitted, inferred by ``normalize_entries``."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:83 of
msgid "覆写映射，与 ``.fya`` 单键映射项的值同构；``None`` 为无覆写。"
msgstr "The override mapping, isomorphic to the value of a single-key mapping entry in ``.fya``; ``None`` means no override."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:85 of
msgid "新创建的 ``ToolEntry`` （便于链式修改，如置 ``enabled``）。"
msgstr "The newly created ``ToolEntry`` (convenient for chained modification, e.g. setting ``enabled``)."

#: ../../api/flowing.rst
msgid "抛出"
msgstr "Raises"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:86 of
msgid "引用未在注册表 / 查找链。"
msgstr "The reference is in neither the registry nor the lookup chain."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:71 flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:87 of
msgid "同 alias 条目已存在。"
msgstr "An entry with the same alias already exists."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:72 flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:88 of
msgid "EntryRef 与 ``alias`` / ``body`` 重复给值；``body`` 含未知键或非法形态。"
msgstr "An ``EntryRef`` is given together with redundant ``alias`` / ``body`` values; ``body`` contains unknown keys or an illegal shape."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool:91 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry`、 "
":meth:`tool_call`、:class:`flowing.parser.EntryRef`"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry`, "
":meth:`tool_call`, :class:`flowing.parser.EntryRef`"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:1 of
msgid ""
"向本 Agent 添加一条子 Agent 绑定条目（``_subagent_entries`` 的公开写入入口）——与 "
":meth:`add_tool` 同构。"
msgstr ""
"Add a subagent binding entry to this Agent (the public write entry point of "
"``_subagent_entries``) — isomorphic to :meth:`add_tool`."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:6 of
msgid ""
"命名注意：本方法添加的是类型绑定条目（Agent 类 + LLM 可见声明 + 覆写），不是 Agent 实例——实例创建走 "
":meth:`create_subagent` / :meth:`invoke_subagent`。「add」的对象是「这个 Agent "
"如何使用某子 Agent 类型」的声明。按引用找到子 Agent 类型，判别覆写体并构造 "
":class:`flowing.subagents.SubagentEntry`，以别名为 key 写入 "
"``self._subagent_entries``。从此该类型进入本 Agent 的 catalog （``enabled=True`` 时对 "
"LLM 可见）与可唤起集 （``invoke_subagent()`` 仅按别名查本表）。"
msgstr ""
"Naming note: what this method adds is a type binding entry (Agent class + LLM-visible declaration "
"+ overrides), not an Agent instance — instance creation goes through :meth:`create_subagent` / "
":meth:`invoke_subagent`. What is 'added' is the declaration of 'how this Agent uses a given "
"subagent type'. The subagent type is located by reference, the override body is discriminated and "
"a :class:`flowing.subagents.SubagentEntry` is constructed and written into "
"``self._subagent_entries`` keyed by alias. From then on the type enters this Agent's catalog "
"(visible to the LLM when ``enabled=True``) and invocable set (``invoke_subagent()`` looks up "
"this table by alias only)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:15 of
msgid "两种调用形态（与 ``add_tool`` 同一管线）："
msgstr "Two calling forms (same pipeline as ``add_tool``):"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:17 of
msgid ""
"``.fya`` 装配层（主调用方）：``subagents:`` 条目解析产出的 ``EntryRef`` "
"直接透传——``add_agent(ref)``，此时 ``alias`` / ``body`` 必须缺省（与 ``ref`` 自带字段重复 → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError`）；"
msgstr ""
"The ``.fya`` assembly layer (the main caller): the ``EntryRef`` produced by parsing a "
"``subagents:`` entry is passed through directly — ``add_agent(ref)``; in this case ``alias`` / "
"``body`` must be omitted (duplicating the fields carried by ``ref`` → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError`);"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:21 of
msgid ""
"程序化（``setup()`` / 运行期）：调用 ``add_agent(name, alias=..., "
"body=...)``，``body`` 与 ``.fya`` 单键映射项的覆写映射同构 （键集 ``system_prompt`` / "
"``description`` / ``args`` / ``enabled``——无 ``output``：输出 schema 覆写是 Tool"
" 面概念； 无 ``inject`` 键，注入写 args 里的 ``\"{{ self.inject('key') }}\"`` "
"表达式）；内部经 :func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries` 构造 EntryRef。"
msgstr ""
"Programmatic (``setup()`` / runtime): call ``add_agent(name, alias=..., body=...)``; ``body`` "
"is isomorphic to the override mapping of a single-key mapping entry in ``.fya`` (key set "
"``system_prompt`` / ``description`` / ``args`` / ``enabled`` — no ``output``: output schema "
"override is a Tool-side concept; no ``inject`` key either, injections are written as "
"``\"{{ self.inject('key') }}\"`` expressions inside args); internally an EntryRef is constructed "
"via :func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries`."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:30 of
msgid ""
"``name`` 接受全部引用形态，与 ``.fya`` 声明完全一致：裸名 / ``ns::name`` / 相对路径（``./`` "
"``../``，相对本 Agent 的 ``source_dir``）/ 绝对路径 / ``@/`` 锚定路径。"
msgstr ""
"``name`` accepts all reference forms, exactly as in ``.fya`` declarations: bare name / "
"``ns::name`` / relative path (``./`` ``../``, relative to this Agent's ``source_dir``) / "
"absolute path / ``@/``-anchored path."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:36 of
msgid "同步、立即生效：下一次上下文组装即渲染进 catalog。"
msgstr "Synchronous and effective immediately: rendered into the catalog at the next context assembly."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:37 of
msgid ""
"同 alias 重复添加 → :class:`flowing.errors.EntryNameConflictError` （绑定层统一 "
"fail-fast，与 tool / skill 同口径）。"
msgstr ""
"Adding the same alias twice → :class:`flowing.errors.EntryNameConflictError` (the binding layer "
"is uniformly fail-fast, same standard as tool / skill)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:39 of
msgid ""
"body 判别（本方法体内，单点维护）：键集固定为 ``system_prompt`` / ``description`` / ``args`` "
"/ ``enabled``；未知键 → :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` （含不接受 ``inject`` "
"键）。 各键去向："
msgstr ""
"body discrimination (maintained at a single point inside this method): the key set is fixed as "
"``system_prompt`` / ``description`` / ``args`` / ``enabled``; unknown keys → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` (``inject`` is not accepted either). Where each key goes:"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:44 of
msgid ""
"``system_prompt`` → ``override_system_prompt``；``str`` 包装为 "
":class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable`，``Parsable`` 透传，``_`` （PENDING）→ "
"空补丁（视为无覆写）。求值时机：子 Agent 创建时 一次，上下文为亲代 Agent 实例；"
msgstr ""
"``system_prompt`` → ``override_system_prompt``; a ``str`` is wrapped into a "
":class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable`, a ``Parsable`` is passed through, ``_`` (PENDING) → empty "
"patch (treated as no override). Evaluation timing: once when the subagent is created, with the "
"parent Agent instance as context;"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:48 of
msgid ""
"``description`` → ``override_description``，同上包装；求值 时机：亲代 Agent 路由决策 / "
"catalog 渲染时，上下文为亲代 Agent 实例；"
msgstr ""
"``description`` → ``override_description``, wrapped as above; evaluation timing: at the parent "
"Agent's routing decision / catalog rendering, with the parent Agent instance as context;"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:51 of
msgid ""
"``args`` → 逐参数判别（规则同 ``add_tool``）：dict 值 → ``override_params``；键含 ``as``"
" → ``param_aliases``；``_`` → 空补丁；其它值 → ``specified`` （包装 Parsable， "
"``invoke_subagent()`` 内以亲代 Agent 实例上下文求值）。差异： ``inject`` 目标是子 Agent "
"初始化参数而非 ``execute()`` 参数；"
msgstr ""
"``args`` → per-parameter discrimination (same rules as ``add_tool``): dict values → "
"``override_params``; keys containing ``as`` → ``param_aliases``; ``_`` → empty patch; other "
"values → ``specified`` (wrapped in Parsable, evaluated inside ``invoke_subagent()`` with the "
"parent Agent instance as context). Difference: the ``inject`` target is the subagent's "
"initialization parameters, not ``execute()`` parameters;"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:57 of
msgid "深层块（``$subagents.<alias>.xxx:``）填回先于本方法调用（装配层 时序约束，与 tool 侧同律）。"
msgstr "The fill-back of deep blocks (``$subagents.<alias>.xxx:``) happens before this method is called (assembly-layer ordering constraint, same rule as the tool side)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:59 of
msgid ""
"边缘情况：``name`` / ``ref.raw`` 未命中 → 经 :meth:`get_agent_class` （携带 "
"``source_dir``）走文件链惰性解析——文件覆盖 ``default::`` / ``builtin::``；仍不命中抛 "
"``KeyError``。"
msgstr ""
"Edge case: ``name`` / ``ref.raw`` misses → lazily resolved via :meth:`get_agent_class` (carrying "
"``source_dir``) through the file chain — files override ``default::`` / ``builtin::``; if it "
"still misses, ``KeyError`` is raised."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:62 of
msgid "entry 不持有子 Agent 类引用以外的任何实例状态；不写持久化 （条目表由声明 / ``setup()`` 重建）。"
msgstr "The entry holds no instance state beyond the subagent class reference; nothing is persisted (the entry table is rebuilt from declarations / ``setup()``)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:65 of
msgid "引用串（全形态，见上）或 ``.fya`` 解析产出的 ``EntryRef`` （此时 ``alias`` / ``body`` 必须缺省）。"
msgstr "A reference string (all forms, see above) or an ``EntryRef`` produced by ``.fya`` parsing (in which case ``alias`` / ``body`` must be omitted)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:67 of
msgid "catalog 与 ``invoke_subagent`` 用的别名；缺省按 ``normalize_entries`` 推断。"
msgstr "The alias used by the catalog and ``invoke_subagent``; when omitted, inferred by ``normalize_entries``."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:69 of
msgid "覆写映射，与 ``.fya`` 单键映射项的值同构。"
msgstr "The override mapping, isomorphic to the value of a single-key mapping entry in ``.fya``."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:70 of
msgid "新创建的 ``SubagentEntry``。"
msgstr "The newly created ``SubagentEntry``."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:74 of
msgid "引用在注册表与文件链均不命中。"
msgstr "The reference hits neither the registry nor the file chain."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.add_agent:76 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.subagents.SubagentEntry`、 "
":meth:`invoke_subagent`、:meth:`add_tool` （同构管线）"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.subagents.SubagentEntry`, "
":meth:`invoke_subagent`, :meth:`add_tool` (isomorphic pipeline)"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.provide:1 of
msgid "在本节点注册 provide 值（写入 ``_provided``）。"
msgstr "Register a provide value on this node (written into ``_provided``)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.provide:5 of
msgid ""
"ProvideNode 协议实现（Runtime / Workflow / Agent 同一套模式）。 同名 key "
"覆盖写——实例运行期覆盖是合法的动态更新（``inject`` 实时查找不缓存，更新即刻可见）。"
msgstr ""
"Implementation of the ProvideNode protocol (the same pattern for Runtime / Workflow / Agent). "
"A same-named key is overwritten — runtime overriding on an instance is a legal dynamic update "
"(``inject`` looks up in real time without caching, so updates are visible immediately)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.provide:18 of
msgid "敏感信息（身份 / 工作区 / 凭证派生值）的正确通道：不进消息流、 不进 LLM 上下文、不经网络传输、不落盘。"
msgstr "The correct channel for sensitive information (identity / workspace / credential-derived values): it does not enter the message stream, the LLM context, network transmission, or the disk."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.provide:20 of
msgid "不做深拷贝、不做序列化——存的是对象引用。"
msgstr "No deep copy, no serialization — what is stored is the object reference."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.provide:22 of
msgid ":meth:`inject`、:class:`flowing.params.InjectionKey`"
msgstr ":meth:`inject`, :class:`flowing.params.InjectionKey`"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.inject:1 of
msgid "沿 ``_parent_id`` 链上溯查找 provide 值（终点 = Runtime）。"
msgstr "Walk up the ``_parent_id`` chain to find a provide value (terminus = Runtime)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.inject:5 of
msgid ""
"统一算法见 :func:`flowing.provide.inject_from`：当前节点 ``_provided`` → 亲节点 → … → "
"``Runtime._provided``；都找不到 → ``MissingProvideError(key)``。"
msgstr ""
"For the unified algorithm see :func:`flowing.provide.inject_from`: current node's ``_provided`` "
"→ parent node → … → ``Runtime._provided``; if none has it → ``MissingProvideError(key)``."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.inject:11 of
msgid ""
"上溯沿 UID 链（``runtime.get_node(parent_id)``），节点间不持 对象引用；亲节点已销毁 / 摘除时链断 → "
"按找不到处理。"
msgstr ""
"The walk goes along the UID chain (``runtime.get_node(parent_id)``); nodes hold no object "
"references to each other; if the parent node has been destroyed / detached the chain breaks → "
"treated as not found."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.inject:13 of
msgid "跨层共享的正确机制（args 只向下传一层，inject 沿链自动穿透）。"
msgstr "The correct mechanism for cross-layer sharing (args is passed down only one layer; inject penetrates automatically along the chain)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.inject:14 of
msgid "类型信息不跨节点：``InjectionKey[T]`` 的 ``T`` 是声明侧约定， 框架不做运行时校验。"
msgstr "Type information does not cross nodes: the ``T`` of ``InjectionKey[T]`` is a declaration-side convention; the framework performs no runtime validation."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.inject flowing.subagents.SubagentEntry.resolve of
msgid "raises flowing.errors.MissingProvideError"
msgstr "raises flowing.errors.MissingProvideError"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.inject:16 of
msgid "链上溯到底仍无"
msgstr "the chain is walked all the way up and still no"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.inject:17 of
msgid "key。"
msgstr "key."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.inject:19 of
msgid ""
":meth:`provide`、:func:`flowing.provide.inject_from`、 "
":class:`flowing.params.InjectionKey` —— 类型安全键。"
msgstr ""
":meth:`provide`, :func:`flowing.provide.inject_from`, "
":class:`flowing.params.InjectionKey` — the type-safe key."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.get_resource:1 of
msgid "获取 Runtime 注册的资源（重资源惰性按需通道）。"
msgstr "Get a resource registered on the Runtime (the lazy on-demand channel for heavy resources)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.get_resource:5 of
msgid ""
"委托 ``Runtime.get_resource``；``setup()`` 轻量约束下，重资源 （渲染器 / 连接池 / "
"缓存）经此按需获取而非在声明层构造。资源是 跨任务复用的对象（区别于 Agent 实例不跨任务复用）。"
msgstr ""
"Delegates to ``Runtime.get_resource``; under the lightweight constraint of ``setup()``, heavy "
"resources (renderers / connection pools / caches) are fetched on demand here rather than "
"constructed at the declaration layer. A resource is an object reused across tasks (unlike Agent "
"instances, which are not reused across tasks)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.get_resource of
msgid "raises flowing.errors.ResourceNotFoundError"
msgstr "raises flowing.errors.ResourceNotFoundError"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.get_resource:18 of
msgid "名称未注册。"
msgstr "The name is not registered."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.get_resource:20 of
msgid ":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.register_resource`"
msgstr ":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.register_resource`"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.watch:1 of
msgid "监听实例属性赋值事件——watcher 通道的 ``(new, old)`` 糖。"
msgstr "Watch instance attribute assignment events — the ``(new, old)`` sugar of the watcher channel."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.watch:5 of
msgid ""
"回调签名 ``(new_value, old_value) -> None``，返回值忽略；同步或 async 均可。内部把回调包成 "
"watcher handler ``(agent, fu)``，经 ``self.hooks.watch(name, wrapped)`` 注册到"
" watcher 通道——它不是 普通钩子点，不参与改写 / ``Intercepted`` / ``shortcut``，永远 fire-"
"and-forget。"
msgstr ""
"The callback signature is ``(new_value, old_value) -> None``; the return value is ignored; sync "
"or async both work. Internally the callback is wrapped into a watcher handler ``(agent, fu)`` "
"and registered into the watcher channel via ``self.hooks.watch(name, wrapped)`` — it is not a "
"normal hook point: it does not participate in rewriting / ``Intercepted`` / ``shortcut`` and is "
"always fire-and-forget."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.watch:13 of
msgid ""
"``name`` 按 ``fnmatch`` pattern 匹配赋值事件的字段名：字面量 即精确匹配；通配符（``\"*\"`` 等）按 "
"fnmatch 规则生效。"
msgstr ""
"``name`` matches the field name of assignment events as an ``fnmatch`` pattern: a literal is an "
"exact match; wildcards (``\"*\"`` etc.) take effect per fnmatch rules."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.watch:15 of
msgid ""
"纯观察 + fire-and-forget：watcher 在后台任务中执行，不阻塞 赋值；多次赋值的 watcher 执行顺序不保证；无运行中 "
"event loop 时 watcher 不触发（赋值照常）。"
msgstr ""
"Pure observation + fire-and-forget: watchers execute in background tasks and never block the "
"assignment; the execution order of watchers across multiple assignments is not guaranteed; with "
"no running event loop watchers do not fire (the assignment still proceeds)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.watch:18 of
msgid "``handler=None`` 时返回装饰器（``@self.watch(\"x\")`` 写法）； 否则注册并原样返回 handler。"
msgstr "With ``handler=None`` a decorator is returned (the ``@self.watch(\"x\")`` style); otherwise the handler is registered and returned as-is."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.watch:20 of
msgid ""
"监听的是赋值事件本身，不监听解析值变化： ``self.c = Parsable(\"{{ a == b }}\")`` 后改 ``a`` 不触发"
" ``watch(\"c\")``； 重新赋值（换 Parsable、赋非 Parsable 值、赋 ``_``）才触发。"
msgstr ""
"What is watched is the assignment event itself, not changes of the resolved value: after "
"``self.c = Parsable(\"{{ a == b }}\")``, changing ``a`` does not trigger ``watch(\"c\")``; only "
"re-assignment (a new Parsable, a non-Parsable value, or ``_``) triggers it."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.watch:24 of
msgid "需要完整值对象时，直接经 ``self.hooks.watch`` 注册 ``(agent, fu)`` 形态的 watcher。"
msgstr "When the full value object is needed, register a watcher of the ``(agent, fu)`` form directly via ``self.hooks.watch``."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.watch:29 of
msgid ":class:`FieldUpdate` —— watcher value。"
msgstr ":class:`FieldUpdate` — the watcher value."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.watch:30 of
msgid ":meth:`parsable` —— 惰性求值侧。"
msgstr ":meth:`parsable` — the lazy-evaluation side."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.parsable:1 of
msgid "手动创建已绑定本实例的 :class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable`。"
msgstr "Manually create a :class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable` already bound to this instance."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.parsable:5 of
msgid ""
"不走 ``__setattr__`` 拦截的手动通道：产物已绑定本实例，``str()`` / ``resolve()`` "
"默认以本实例为渲染上下文（合并 ``env`` / ``config`` 顶层变量）。"
msgstr ""
"The manual channel that bypasses ``__setattr__`` interception: the product is already bound to "
"this instance; ``str()`` / ``resolve()`` use this instance as the default rendering context "
"(merging the top-level variables of ``env`` / ``config``)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.parsable:18 of
msgid ""
"框架不为 Parsable 做隐式解包——``_extra`` / entry 覆写等求值面外 位置拿到的 Parsable 需手动 "
"``.resolve(context)``。"
msgstr ""
"The framework never unwraps a Parsable implicitly — a Parsable obtained at positions outside the "
"evaluation surface, such as ``_extra`` / entry overrides, must be manually resolved with "
"``.resolve(context)``."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.parsable:21 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable` （五形式与两步渲染）"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable` (the five forms and two-step rendering)"

#: flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot:1 of
msgid "一致性只读快照：单个 Agent 状态的观测入口。"
msgstr "Consistent read-only snapshot: the observation entry point for a single Agent's state."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot:5 of
msgid ""
"返回 :class:`flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot`——``node_id`` / ``parent_id`` /"
" 消息树摘要 / ``current_head_id`` / 当前逻辑 Turn 视图 / ``executions`` / 队列摘要 / "
"模型视图 / 工具与子 Agent 绑定 条目 / "
"上下文占用估计（``context_usage``，:meth:`estimate_context_tokens` "
"的快照时刻取值）的一次性只读视图。供测试断言、repl ``/snapshot``、 观测扩展使用。"
msgstr ""
"Returns :class:`flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot` — a one-shot read-only view of ``node_id`` / "
"``parent_id`` / a message-tree summary / ``current_head_id`` / the current logical Turn view / "
"``executions`` / a queue summary / the model view / the tool and subagent binding entries / the "
"context usage estimate (``context_usage``, the value of :meth:`estimate_context_tokens` at the "
"snapshot moment). Used by test assertions, the repl ``/snapshot`` command, and observability "
"extensions."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot:22 of
msgid "只读：修改返回对象不影响 Agent；字段为拷贝或 Info 视图。"
msgstr "Read-only: mutating the returned object does not affect the Agent; fields are copies or Info views."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot:23 flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot:21 of
msgid "一致性：单次调用内各字段取同一时刻的读值。"
msgstr "Consistency: within a single call, all fields are read at the same moment."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot:24 of
msgid ""
"``keys``：``None`` （默认）收集全部切面；指定时只收集指定字段 （其余为 ``None``——如不需要 "
"``context_usage`` 的锚点扫描开销， 可不收它）。需要多切面同一时刻一致 → 同一次调用传入全部所需 key。"
msgstr ""
"``keys``: ``None`` (default) collects all facets; when specified, only the given fields are "
"collected (the rest are ``None`` — e.g. if you don't need the anchor-scanning cost of "
"``context_usage``, leave it out). To make multiple facets consistent at the same moment, pass "
"all the keys you need in a single call."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot:28 of
msgid "可序列化：全部字段 JSON 可序列化。"
msgstr "Serializable: all fields are JSON-serializable."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot:29 of
msgid "``current_turn`` 为 ``None`` 表示空闲（无活跃逻辑 Turn）。"
msgstr "``current_turn`` being ``None`` means idle (no active logical Turn)."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot:30 flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot:29 of
msgid "完整字段契约见 :mod:`flowing.snapshot` 模块级 docstring。"
msgstr "For the full field contract see the module-level docstring of :mod:`flowing.snapshot`."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot:32 of
msgid "要收集的切面字段名集合；``None`` 表示全部。"
msgstr "The set of facet field names to collect; ``None`` means all."

#: flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot:34 of
msgid ""
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot`、 "
":class:`flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot`"
msgstr ""
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot`, "
":class:`flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot`"

#: flowing.tool.Audio:1 of
msgid "工具返回音频时使用的媒体载体——与 `Image` 同构，产物 ``AudioBlock``。字段语义与校验规则见 `Image`。"
msgstr "The media carrier used when a tool returns audio — isomorphic to `Image`, producing an ``AudioBlock``. For field semantics and validation rules see `Image`."

#: flowing.agent.CancelContext:1 of
msgid "``before_cancel`` / ``after_cancel`` 钩子点的 value——取消操作的上下文。"
msgstr "The value of the ``before_cancel`` / ``after_cancel`` hook points — the context of a cancel operation."

#: flowing.agent.CancelContext:5 of
msgid ""
"``cancel()`` 在置位任何取消信号之前 dispatch ``before_cancel``， handler 可 ``raise "
"Intercepted`` 阻止取消——适用于当前操作不可中断的 场景（支付已提交、关键事务进行中）。``after_cancel`` "
"在信号置位后 立即 dispatch，是「取消请求已被接受」的事实事件（纯观察）。"
msgstr ""
"``cancel()`` dispatches ``before_cancel`` before setting any cancel signal; a handler may "
"``raise Intercepted`` to prevent the cancellation — for scenarios where the current operation "
"must not be interrupted (payment submitted, critical transaction in progress). ``after_cancel`` "
"is dispatched immediately after the signal is set; it is the factual event that 'the cancel "
"request has been accepted' (pure observation)."

#: flowing.agent.CancelContext:12 of
msgid ""
"``reason`` 是取消原因说明。``Agent.cancel()`` / ``stop()`` 均不接受 原因参数（无参），框架内部 "
"dispatch 时填默认值 ``\"\"``；扩展若自行 dispatch ``before_cancel`` 可携带自定义原因。"
msgstr ""
"``reason`` describes the reason for cancellation. ``Agent.cancel()`` / ``stop()`` accept no "
"reason parameter (they are parameterless), so the framework fills the default ``\"\"`` when it "
"dispatches internally; an extension that dispatches ``before_cancel`` itself may carry a custom "
"reason."

#: flowing.agent.CancelContext:15 of
msgid ""
"handler ``raise Intercepted`` → 取消被阻止，``_executions`` 与 ``_turn_abort`` "
"均不置位。"
msgstr ""
"A handler raising ``Intercepted`` → the cancellation is prevented; neither ``_executions`` nor "
"``_turn_abort`` is set."

#: flowing.agent.CancelContext:17 of
msgid "handler 普通异常 → 直接上抛给 ``cancel()`` 调用方，信号不置位。"
msgstr "An ordinary handler exception → propagated directly to the ``cancel()`` caller; the signal is not set."

#: flowing.agent.CancelContext:21 of
msgid ":meth:`Agent.cancel` —— 触发点。"
msgstr ":meth:`Agent.cancel` — the trigger point."

#: flowing.agent.CancelContext:22 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted` —— 阻断信号。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted` — the blocking signal."

#: flowing.CancelContext.reason:1 flowing.agent.CancelContext.reason:1 of
msgid "取消原因；框架内部调用恒为 ``\"\"`` （cancel 族无参），供扩展 自行 dispatch 时携带。"
msgstr "The cancel reason; always ``\"\"`` for internal framework calls (the cancel family takes no arguments); carried by extensions when they dispatch themselves."

#: flowing.params.ConfigKey:1 of
msgid "配置读取的类型安全键——镜像 :class:`InjectionKey` 模式。"
msgstr "The type-safe key for config reads — mirroring the :class:`InjectionKey` pattern."

#: flowing.params.ConfigKey:5 of
msgid ""
"``ConfigKey[T]`` 是 :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_config` 的键 类型：泛型参数 "
"``T`` 声明该配置值的 Python 类型，``name`` 是配置项 的键名（约定为含命名空间的点分路径，如 "
"``\"retry.max_attempts\"`` / ``\"i18n.locale\"``）。``get_config(key, "
"default=...)`` 的 ``default`` 参数类型须与 ``T`` 一致，否则静态检查报错——这把「键名 → 值类型」 "
"的对应关系固化为可静态检查的契约。与裸字符串 key 共存：字符串简写 返回值类型为 ``Any``。与 ``InjectionKey`` "
"同模式——类型信息只在 调用侧生效，配置存储层按字符串键存取，不感知泛型。"
msgstr ""
"``ConfigKey[T]`` is the key type of :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_config`: the generic "
"parameter ``T`` declares the Python type of that config value, and ``name`` is the key name of "
"the config item (by convention a namespaced dotted path, e.g. ``\"retry.max_attempts\"`` / "
"``\"i18n.locale\"``). The ``default`` argument of ``get_config(key, default=...)`` must match "
"``T`` or static checkers report an error — this freezes the 'key name → value type' "
"correspondence into a statically checkable contract. It coexists with bare string keys: the "
"string shorthand yields ``Any``. Same pattern as ``InjectionKey`` — type information takes "
"effect only at the call site; the config storage layer reads and writes by string keys and is "
"unaware of the generic."

#: flowing.params.ConfigKey:33 of
msgid ""
"``name`` 创建后不可变；命名空间段（``retry``、``i18n``）是约定 而非本类强制——命名空间的注册与「谁负责校验」由 "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.register_config_namespace` 管理； "
"``get_config`` 不做命名空间访问控制，任何代码可读取任何命名空间 下的值。"
msgstr ""
"``name`` is immutable after creation; the namespace segments (``retry``, ``i18n``) are a "
"convention, not enforced by this class — namespace registration and 'who validates what' are "
"managed by :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.register_config_namespace`; ``get_config`` performs "
"no namespace access control: any code may read values under any namespace."

#: flowing.params.ConfigKey:38 of
msgid ""
"``__eq__`` / ``__hash__`` 语义与 :class:`InjectionKey` 相同：按 ``name`` 与另一个 "
"``ConfigKey`` 或裸 ``str`` 比较，哈希等于 ``hash(self.name)``；``__str__`` 同样返回 "
"``name``。"
msgstr ""
"``__eq__`` / ``__hash__`` semantics are the same as :class:`InjectionKey`: comparison by "
"``name`` against another ``ConfigKey`` or a bare ``str``; the hash equals "
"``hash(self.name)``; ``__str__`` likewise returns ``name``."

#: flowing.params.ConfigKey:41 of
msgid "运行期不做 ``T`` 的类型校验：配置文件里实际值类型与 ``T`` 不符 时框架不拦截（静态契约，非运行期校验器）。"
msgstr "No runtime type validation of ``T``: if the actual value in the config file does not match ``T``, the framework does not intercept it (a static contract, not a runtime validator)."

#: flowing.params.ConfigKey:43 of
msgid ""
"调用时机约束（消费侧规则）：``get_config`` 在配置就绪前调用抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.ConfigNotReadyError` （典型即模块顶层 import "
"期）；就绪后任何时机可调用（``setup()``、钩子回调、工具 callable、 ``main()`` "
"后续代码）。本类本身无此约束——约束在读取配置的 Runtime 方法上。"
msgstr ""
"Call-timing constraint (consumer-side rule): calling ``get_config`` before the config is ready "
"raises :class:`flowing.errors.ConfigNotReadyError` (typically at module top-level import time); "
"once ready it may be called at any time (``setup()``, hook callbacks, tool callables, code "
"after ``main()``). This class itself carries no such constraint — the constraint lives on the "
"Runtime method that reads config."

#: flowing.params.ConfigKey:48 of
msgid ""
"同名异型键（``ConfigKey[int](\"x\")`` vs ``ConfigKey[str](\"x\")``） "
"运行期相等——静态错误，框架不检测。"
msgstr ""
"Same-name keys of different types (``ConfigKey[int](\"x\")`` vs ``ConfigKey[str](\"x\")``) are "
"equal at runtime — a static error the framework does not detect."

#: flowing.params.ConfigKey:51 of
msgid ""
":class:`InjectionKey` —— 同模式的注入键； "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_config` —— 消费入口与调用 "
"时机约束；:meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.register_config_namespace` —— 命名空间注册。"
msgstr ""
":class:`InjectionKey` — the injection key of the same pattern; "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_config` — the consumption entry point and call-timing "
"constraint; :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.register_config_namespace` — namespace registration."

#: flowing.ConfigKey.name:1 flowing.params.ConfigKey.name:1 of
msgid "配置键名（约定为含命名空间的点分路径）；创建后不可变；与同名裸 字符串等价（同哈希、相等比较一致）。"
msgstr "The config key name (by convention a namespaced dotted path); immutable after creation; equivalent to the same-named bare string (same hash, consistent equality)."

#: flowing.message.ContentBlock:1 of
msgid "消息内容片段基类：``type`` 字段判别「这一段是什么」（八种 type）。"
msgstr "Base class of message content fragments: the ``type`` field discriminates 'what this piece is' (eight types)."

#: flowing.message.ContentBlock:5 of
msgid ""
"一条 :class:`Message` 的 ``content`` 列表可含多种 type 的 "
"ContentBlock，交错排列（Anthropic 原生支持；OpenAI / Gemini 由 adapter 做映射转换，如 OpenAI"
" 的 ``tool_calls[]`` 逐项转回 block 以保持交错顺序）。"
msgstr ""
"The ``content`` list of a :class:`Message` may hold ContentBlocks of multiple types, interleaved "
"(natively supported by Anthropic; OpenAI / Gemini rely on adapter mapping, e.g. OpenAI's "
"``tool_calls[]`` is converted item by item back into blocks to preserve the interleaved order)."

#: flowing.message.ContentBlock:10 of
msgid ""
"block 化的消息内容使多模态（文本 + 图像 + 文件混排）、思考过程 "
"（thinking）、工具调用（tool_call）在同一个消息模型内统一表达，与 具体 Provider API 的内容结构解耦。媒体块一律 "
"base64 内联（``data`` 必填且是权威表示）：文件路径、URL、剪贴板进入消息层后是同一格式， adapter 从统一 base64 "
"出发做各 API 转换。"
msgstr ""
"Block-structured message content lets multimodality (text + image + file interleaving), the "
"thinking process (thinking), and tool calls (tool_call) be expressed uniformly within a single "
"message model, decoupled from the content structures of concrete Provider APIs. Media blocks are "
"always inlined as base64 (``data`` is required and is the authoritative representation): file "
"paths, URLs, and clipboard contents all become the same format once they enter the message "
"layer, and adapters convert from the unified base64 to each API."

#: flowing.message.ContentBlock:18 of
msgid ""
"框架核心只接纳 base64 数据，不做文件大小检查（大小治理分层： 前端上传前校验 → ``before_enqueue`` 钩子 → "
"Provider adapter 的 ``ContextLengthError`` 兜底）。"
msgstr ""
"The framework core only accepts base64 data and performs no file-size check (size governance is "
"layered: pre-upload validation in the frontend → the ``before_enqueue`` hook → the Provider "
"adapter's ``ContextLengthError`` as backstop)."

#: flowing.message.ContentBlock:21 of
msgid "``mime_type`` 始终可选：缺失时由 adapter 按文件扩展名或内容魔数 推断；显式指定优先。"
msgstr "``mime_type`` is always optional: when missing, the adapter infers it from the file extension or content magic bytes; an explicit value takes precedence."

#: flowing.message.ContentBlock:23 of
msgid "降级策略属 UI / Provider 层（非框架核心）：video → 首帧截图或 文件引用；audio → 占位文本或语音转文字。"
msgstr "Degradation strategies belong to the UI / Provider layer (not the framework core): video → first-frame screenshot or file reference; audio → placeholder text or speech-to-text."

#: flowing.message.ContentBlock:25 of
msgid ""
"边界区分：``text`` 与 ``file`` （可读字符串与二进制）；``image`` 与 ``video`` "
"（单帧与连续帧）；``image`` 与 ``file`` （多模态视觉 输入与仅作文件传递）；``audio`` 与 ``file`` "
"（需语音理解与仅传 mp3）；``struct`` 与 ``text`` （程序可读的 JSON 结构与纯文本—— 对 LLM 的投影同为文本）。"
msgstr ""
"Boundary distinctions: ``text`` vs ``file`` (readable string vs binary); ``image`` vs ``video`` "
"(single frame vs continuous frames); ``image`` vs ``file`` (multimodal visual input vs mere file "
"transfer); ``audio`` vs ``file`` (speech understanding needed vs merely passing an mp3); "
"``struct`` vs ``text`` (a machine-readable JSON structure vs plain text — both project to text "
"for the LLM)."

#: flowing.message.ContentBlock:32 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.message.Message`、 :mod:`flowing.model` （adapter 逐 type "
"映射）。"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.message.Message`, :mod:`flowing.model` (adapters map type by type)."

#: flowing.ContentBlock.type:1 flowing.message.ContentBlock.type:1 of
msgid ""
"片段类型判别，八值之一：``\"text\" | \"thinking\" | \"tool_call\" | \"struct\" | "
"\"image\" | \"video\" | \"audio\" | \"file\"``。 子类将其收窄为对应的 "
"``Literal``。序列化时作为 ``tree.jsonl`` 行内 content 项的判别字段。"
msgstr ""
"Fragment type discriminator, one of eight values: ``\"text\" | \"thinking\" | \"tool_call\" | "
"\"struct\" | \"image\" | \"video\" | \"audio\" | \"file\"``. Subclasses narrow it to the "
"corresponding ``Literal``. On serialization it serves as the discriminator field of content "
"items inside ``tree.jsonl`` lines."

#: flowing.context.Context:1 of
msgid "上下文组装的输出——``Provider.generate()`` 的唯一输入类型。"
msgstr "The output of context assembly — the sole input type of ``Provider.generate()``."

#: flowing.context.Context:5 of
msgid ""
"由 ``flowing.agent.Agent._assemble_context()`` 在每次 ``provider_gen`` "
"前现场组装（遍历 ``prompt_blocks`` 跳过已停用块逐块求值、沿 ``current_head_id`` 的 "
"``parent_id`` 链收集消息路径、取启用工具的 ``llm_definition()`` 产物），经 "
"``before_provider_gen`` 钩子（value 即 本类，可整体改写）后交给 Provider adapter。三个正交字段： "
"``system_prompt`` （分层 prompt 段，保留 cache 标记）、``tools`` （当前 "
"启用的工具定义）、``messages`` （根→head 消息路径）。三字段结构让 adapter "
"的映射是机械的逐字段转换（kind→role、cache→cache_control、 ToolDefinition→function "
"声明），无需从扁平列表猜测结构。"
msgstr ""
"Assembled on the spot by ``flowing.agent.Agent._assemble_context()`` before every "
"``provider_gen`` (iterating ``prompt_blocks`` to evaluate each enabled block, collecting the "
"message path along the ``parent_id`` chain from ``current_head_id``, and taking the "
"``llm_definition()`` products of enabled tools), then passed through the "
"``before_provider_gen`` hook (whose value is this class and which may rewrite it wholesale) and "
"handed to the Provider adapter. Three orthogonal fields: ``system_prompt`` (layered prompt "
"segments, preserving cache marks), ``tools`` (the currently enabled tool definitions), and "
"``messages`` (the root→head message path). The three-field structure makes the adapter's mapping "
"a mechanical field-by-field conversion (kind→role, cache→cache_control, ToolDefinition→function "
"declaration), with no need to guess structure from a flat list."

#: flowing.context.Context:17 of
msgid "``before_provider_gen`` 钩子整体改写（应用层）："
msgstr "Wholesale rewriting via the ``before_provider_gen`` hook (application layer):"

#: flowing.context.Context:34 of
msgid ""
"``messages`` 为根→head 顺序：从 ``current_head_id`` 沿 ``Message.parent_id`` "
"上溯到根后反转；活跃逻辑 turn 执行中，本 turn 已 append 到树的消息自然在路径上。无活跃 turn（崩溃恢复后、新 turn "
"开始前）行为相同。"
msgstr ""
"``messages`` is in root→head order: walk from ``current_head_id`` up ``Message.parent_id`` to "
"the root, then reverse; while a logical turn is active, messages this turn has already appended "
"to the tree naturally lie on the path. With no active turn (after crash recovery, before a new "
"turn starts) the behavior is the same."

#: flowing.context.Context:38 of
msgid ""
"半截 turn 不截断：最后一条 ``turn_end=True`` 之后已落盘的半截 turn 消息照常进入 ``messages``；孤立 "
"tool_call 由 ``synthetic=True`` 占位 TOOL 消息封闭（``tool_call_id`` 等于孤立调用 id、 "
"``tool_status=\"error\"``），tool_call / tool_result 严格成对。"
msgstr ""
"A half-finished turn is not truncated: persisted half-finished-turn messages after the last "
"``turn_end=True`` still enter ``messages``; an orphaned tool_call is closed by a "
"``synthetic=True`` placeholder TOOL message (whose ``tool_call_id`` equals the orphan call id "
"and ``tool_status=\"error\"``), keeping tool_call / tool_result strictly paired."

#: flowing.context.Context:42 of
msgid ""
"``tools`` 只含 ``enabled=True`` 的工具条目经 ``llm_definition()`` 的 "
"产物，与消息流完全分离。无隐式附加：``subagent-invoke`` / ``finish`` "
"等内置工具同样需用户显式声明（``tools:`` / ``add_tool``）才出现。"
msgstr ""
"``tools`` contains only the ``llm_definition()`` products of tool entries with "
"``enabled=True``, completely separate from the message stream. Nothing is attached implicitly: "
"builtin tools like ``subagent-invoke`` / ``finish`` likewise appear only when the user "
"explicitly declares them (``tools:`` / ``add_tool``)."

#: flowing.context.Context:46 of
msgid "副线消息不出现：主流程组装的 ``messages`` 中不含 ``side_query`` 副线 调用的消息（它们不进树、不落盘）。"
msgstr "No side-branch messages: the ``messages`` assembled by the main flow contain no messages of ``side_query`` side calls (they never enter the tree and are never persisted)."

#: flowing.context.Context:48 of
msgid ""
"框架不对本类做 token 计数、窗口裁剪、长度校验——超长由 Provider adapter 抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.ContextLengthError` 兜底（与其它 调用期异常一样经 "
"``on_provider_error`` 分发，处置属策略）。"
msgstr ""
"The framework performs no token counting, window trimming, or length validation on this class — "
"overlength is backstopped by the Provider adapter raising "
":class:`flowing.errors.ContextLengthError` (dispatched via ``on_provider_error`` like other "
"call-time exceptions; handling is a matter of policy)."

#: flowing.context.Context:51 of
msgid "框架不为本类做 role 映射：kind→API role 是 adapter 的职责。"
msgstr "The framework does no role mapping for this class: kind→API role is the adapter's job."

#: flowing.context.Context:52 of
msgid ""
"改写 ``messages`` 不推荐：``before_provider_gen`` 钩子对 ``messages`` "
"的直接改动不会进入消息树、不会落盘，下一次组装即丢失。内容增删应 走持久化路径：回合开头的注入用 ``before_turn`` 向 "
"``TurnContext.pending_messages`` 附加（随批次挂树落盘）；回合中途的 追加 / 擦除用 "
"``MessageChain`` 手术（``insert`` / ``remove``）。"
msgstr ""
"Rewriting ``messages`` is discouraged: direct changes to ``messages`` made by the "
"``before_provider_gen`` hook never enter the message tree, are never persisted, and are lost at "
"the next assembly. Content additions and removals should go through the persistence path: "
"injections at the start of a turn are appended to ``TurnContext.pending_messages`` via "
"``before_turn`` (attached to the tree and persisted with the batch); mid-turn insertion / "
"erasure uses ``MessageChain`` surgery (``insert`` / ``remove``)."

#: flowing.context.Context:57 of
msgid "每次组装产生全新对象与全新列表；两次组装互不共享可变状态。"
msgstr "Each assembly produces a brand-new object with brand-new lists; two assemblies share no mutable state."

#: flowing.context.Context:58 of
msgid "实例不保证线程安全（单进程 asyncio 模型，无此需求）。"
msgstr "Instances are not guaranteed thread-safe (a single-process asyncio model has no such need)."

#: flowing.context.Context:60 of
msgid "边缘情况："
msgstr "Edge cases:"

#: flowing.context.Context:62 of
msgid ""
"全新 Agent（无任何消息）：``messages == []``、``system_prompt`` 至少 含 ``[0]`` 引用块的 "
"segment、``tools`` 可为空列表——三个字段的空列表 均合法，adapter 不得假设非空。"
msgstr ""
"A brand-new Agent (no messages at all): ``messages == []``, ``system_prompt`` contains at least "
"the segment of the ``[0]`` reference block, ``tools`` may be an empty list — empty lists are "
"legal for all three fields, and adapters must not assume non-emptiness."

#: flowing.context.Context:65 of
msgid "fork 切换 ``current_head_id`` 后，下一次组装自动反映新分支路径—— fork 是纯上下文操作，不需要额外同步。"
msgstr "After a fork switches ``current_head_id``, the next assembly automatically reflects the new branch path — fork is a pure context operation needing no extra synchronization."

#: flowing.Context.system_prompt:7 flowing.context.Context:70
#: flowing.context.Context.system_prompt:7 flowing.context.PromptBlock:52 of
msgid ":class:`PromptSegment`"
msgstr ":class:`PromptSegment`"

#: flowing.context.Context:71 of
msgid "``system_prompt`` 的元素类型。"
msgstr "The element type of ``system_prompt``."

#: flowing.Context.tools:7 flowing.context:113 flowing.context.Context:72
#: flowing.context.Context.tools:7 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolDefinition`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolDefinition`"

#: flowing.context.Context:73 of
msgid "``tools`` 的元素类型。"
msgstr "The element type of ``tools``."

#: flowing.Context.messages:9 flowing.context:111 flowing.context.Context:74
#: flowing.context.Context.messages:9 flowing.hooks:80 flowing.hooks:84
#: flowing.hooks:149 flowing.hooks:153 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.message.Message`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.message.Message`"

#: flowing.context.Context:75 of
msgid "``messages`` 的元素类型。"
msgstr "The element type of ``messages``."

#: flowing.context:115 flowing.context.Context:76
#: flowing.context.PromptSegment:41 of
msgid ":meth:`flowing.providers.Provider.generate`"
msgstr ":meth:`flowing.providers.Provider.generate`"

#: flowing.context.Context:77 flowing.context.PromptSegment:42 of
msgid "最终消费者。"
msgstr "The final consumer."

#: flowing.context.Context:78 flowing.errors:140 flowing.hooks:75
#: flowing.hooks:125 flowing.hooks:129 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext`"

#: flowing.context.Context:79 of
msgid "``pending_messages`` （回合开头附加式注入的载体）。"
msgstr "``pending_messages`` (the carrier of append-style injection at the start of a turn)."

#: flowing.context.Context:80 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.errors.ContextLengthError`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.errors.ContextLengthError`"

#: flowing.context.Context:81 of
msgid "上下文超长的兜底异常。"
msgstr "The backstop exception for overlong context."

#: flowing.Context.system_prompt:1 flowing.context.Context.system_prompt:1 of
msgid ""
"分层 prompt 段（:class:`PromptSegment` 列表）：保留 cache 标记供 adapter 缓存优化；顺序 = "
"块注册顺序（跳过已停用块）。"
msgstr ""
"Layered prompt segments (a :class:`PromptSegment` list): cache marks are preserved for adapter "
"caching optimizations; the order equals block registration order (skipping disabled blocks)."

#: flowing.Context.system_prompt:4 flowing.context.Context.system_prompt:4 of
msgid "行为边界：当次组装的全新求值产物；空列表合法；``before_provider_gen`` 钩子可增删改写。"
msgstr "Behavioral boundaries: a freshly evaluated product of the current assembly; an empty list is legal; the ``before_provider_gen`` hook may add, remove, or rewrite."

#: flowing.Context.tools:1 flowing.context.Context.tools:1 of
msgid ""
"当前启用的工具定义（:class:`flowing.tool.ToolDefinition` 列表）：工具声明 独立于消息流存在，adapter "
"直接映射为各 API 的 function 声明。"
msgstr ""
"The currently enabled tool definitions (a :class:`flowing.tool.ToolDefinition` list): tool "
"declarations exist independently of the message stream; adapters map them directly to each "
"API's function declarations."

#: flowing.Context.tools:4 flowing.context.Context.tools:4 of
msgid "行为边界：只含 ``enabled=True`` 条目的 ``llm_definition()`` 产物；空 列表合法。"
msgstr "Behavioral boundaries: only ``llm_definition()`` products of ``enabled=True`` entries; an empty list is legal."

#: flowing.Context.messages:1 flowing.context.Context.messages:1 of
msgid ""
"根→head 的消息路径（:class:`flowing.message.Message` 列表）：消息级树上 沿 ``parent_id`` "
"上溯收集的对话历史，adapter 逐条做 kind→role 映射。"
msgstr ""
"The root→head message path (a :class:`flowing.message.Message` list): the conversation history "
"collected by walking up ``parent_id`` on the message-level tree; adapters map kind→role message "
"by message."

#: flowing.Context.messages:4 flowing.context.Context.messages:4 of
msgid ""
"行为边界：不含副线消息；半截 turn 不截断；tool_call 与其结果消息严格 成对（配对锚为 PROVIDER 消息内 "
"``ToolCallBlock.id`` 与 TOOL 消息的 ``tool_call_id`` 字段），孤立调用由 ``synthetic`` "
"占位封闭成对，规则见 类 docstring。"
msgstr ""
"Behavioral boundaries: no side-branch messages; half-finished turns are not truncated; a "
"tool_call and its result message are strictly paired (the pairing anchors are "
"``ToolCallBlock.id`` inside the PROVIDER message and the ``tool_call_id`` field of the TOOL "
"message); orphan calls are closed into pairs by ``synthetic`` placeholders — see the class "
"docstring for the rules."

#: flowing.agent.Execution:1 of
msgid "活跃异步执行条目——「谁正在运行、谁可取消」的追踪单位。"
msgstr "An active asynchronous execution entry — the tracking unit of 'who is running and who can be cancelled'."

#: flowing.agent.Execution:5 of
msgid ""
"Agent 发起的每个异步执行（工具调用、子 Agent、LLM 请求、副线查询） 启动时注册一条本实例进 "
"``Agent._executions`` 注册表，完成 / 异常 / 取消后移除（清理在 ``finally`` 中）。``cancel`` /"
" ``stop`` 族通过 遍历该注册表置位控制信号；快照层只投影其中的 ``kind`` / ``tags`` / ``started_at``"
" 三个字段。"
msgstr ""
"Every asynchronous execution started by an Agent (tool call, subagent, LLM request, side query) "
"registers one instance of this class into the ``Agent._executions`` registry at startup, and "
"removes it after completion / exception / cancellation (cleanup happens in ``finally``). The "
"``cancel`` / ``stop`` family sets control signals by iterating this registry; the snapshot "
"layer projects only the three fields ``kind`` / ``tags`` / ``started_at``."

#: flowing.agent.Execution:13 of
msgid ""
"``kind`` 是开放字符串（非封闭枚举）：内置 ``\"tool\"`` / ``\"agent\"`` / ``\"request\"`` "
"/ ``\"side_query\"`` 四种；扩展可引入新值，注册与冲突 规则由扩展自管。"
msgstr ""
"``kind`` is an open string (not a closed enum): four builtin values ``\"tool\"`` / "
"``\"agent\"`` / ``\"request\"`` / ``\"side_query\"``; extensions may introduce new values, with "
"registration and conflict rules managed by the extensions themselves."

#: flowing.agent.Execution:16 of
msgid ""
"``tags`` 供分组取消（``cancel_by_tag`` / ``stop_by_tag``）；典型 用法 "
"``tags=[\"bash\", \"long-running\"]``。"
msgstr ""
"``tags`` supports grouped cancellation (``cancel_by_tag`` / ``stop_by_tag``); a typical usage "
"is ``tags=[\"bash\", \"long-running\"]``."

#: flowing.agent.Execution:18 of
msgid "注册与清理严格成对、清理一定在 ``finally``：执行条目不残留，避免 后续 ``cancel()`` 误伤已完成的执行。"
msgstr "Registration and cleanup are strictly paired, and cleanup always happens in ``finally``: no execution entry leaks, so a later ``cancel()`` cannot accidentally hit a finished execution."

#: flowing.agent.Execution:20 of
msgid ""
"取消是协作式的：``cancel`` 置位是请求不是命令——执行体在检查点检测 信号后自行决定立即停止（返回已有或空结果）、忽略信号正常完成、或 "
"做关键收尾后返回部分结果。框架不设强制终止语义（那是可覆写 ``stop()`` 的职责）。"
msgstr ""
"Cancellation is cooperative: setting ``cancel`` is a request, not a command — upon detecting "
"the signal at a checkpoint the execution body decides for itself whether to stop immediately "
"(returning what it has or an empty result), ignore the signal and finish normally, or return a "
"partial result after critical cleanup. The framework defines no forced-termination semantics "
"(that is the job of the overridable ``stop()``)."

#: flowing.agent.Execution:24 of
msgid ""
"``pause`` 置位同样是协作式请求，保留给 Tool 覆写与 Composable—— 框架核心不主动 set / clear "
"它；只影响单个执行、不级联（区别于 Agent 层 ``pause()`` 对工作循环 gate 的控制）。"
msgstr ""
"Setting ``pause`` is likewise a cooperative request, reserved for Tool overrides and "
"Composables — the framework core never sets / clears it on its own; it affects a single "
"execution only and does not cascade (unlike the Agent-level ``pause()``, which gates the work "
"loop)."

#: flowing.agent.Execution:27 of
msgid ""
"快照（``AgentSnapshot.executions``）只暴露 ``kind`` / ``tags`` / "
"``started_at``，不暴露两个 Event——避免绕过控制 API 与钩子。"
msgstr ""
"The snapshot (``AgentSnapshot.executions``) exposes only ``kind`` / ``tags`` / ``started_at``, "
"not the two Events — to prevent bypassing the control API and hooks."

#: flowing.agent.Execution:32 of
msgid ":meth:`Agent.cancel` / :meth:`Agent.cancel_by_tag` —— 信号置位入口。"
msgstr ":meth:`Agent.cancel` / :meth:`Agent.cancel_by_tag` — the signal-setting entry points."

#: flowing.agent.Execution:33 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.tool.Tool` —— 工具执行的宿主（``execution`` 注入）。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.tool.Tool` — the host of tool execution (the ``execution`` injection)."

#: flowing.Execution.id:1 flowing.agent.Execution.id:1 of
msgid "按 Agent 的自增序列号（纯数字字符串），注册表 ``Agent._executions`` 的 key。"
msgstr "A per-Agent auto-increment serial number (a pure numeric string); the key of the ``Agent._executions`` registry."

#: flowing.Execution.kind:1 flowing.agent.Execution.kind:1 of
msgid ""
"开放字符串：内置 ``\"tool\"`` / ``\"agent\"`` / ``\"request\"`` / "
"``\"side_query\"``；扩展可引入新值。"
msgstr ""
"An open string: builtin values ``\"tool\"`` / ``\"agent\"`` / ``\"request\"`` / "
"``\"side_query\"``; extensions may introduce new values."

#: flowing.Execution.tags:1 flowing.agent.Execution.tags:1 of
msgid "自由标签，``cancel_by_tag`` / ``stop_by_tag`` 的分组依据。"
msgstr "Free-form tags; the grouping basis of ``cancel_by_tag`` / ``stop_by_tag``."

#: flowing.Execution.started_at:1 flowing.agent.Execution.started_at:1 of
msgid "启动时间戳（监控 / 日志 / 超时判断）。"
msgstr "The start timestamp (for monitoring / logging / timeout checks)."

#: flowing.Execution.cancel:1 flowing.agent.Execution.cancel:1 of
msgid ""
"置位 = 请求取消（初始未 set）；协作式信号，执行体可自行决定 是否响应。词汇约定：执行侧统一叫 cancel（方法 ``cancel()``"
" / ``cancel_by_tag()``、钩子 ``before_cancel`` / ``after_cancel`` 与本 "
"字段）；Turn 循环一侧保留 abort（``abort_turn()`` / ``before_turn_abort`` / "
"``turn.aborted``）——两个域的词汇各自内部 自洽，不跨域混用。"
msgstr ""
"Being set = cancellation requested (initially unset); a cooperative signal — the execution body "
"decides for itself whether to respond. Vocabulary convention: the execution side uniformly says "
"cancel (methods ``cancel()`` / ``cancel_by_tag()``, hooks ``before_cancel`` / "
"``after_cancel``, and this field); the Turn-loop side keeps abort (``abort_turn()`` / "
"``before_turn_abort`` / ``turn.aborted``) — each domain's vocabulary is internally "
"self-consistent and the two are never mixed across domains."

#: flowing.Execution.pause:1 flowing.agent.Execution.pause:1 of
msgid ""
"置位 = 请求暂停（初始未 set）；保留给 Tool 覆写与 Composable， 框架核心不主动 set / "
"clear；只影响单个执行，不级联。"
msgstr ""
"Being set = pause requested (initially unset); reserved for Tool overrides and Composables — "
"the framework core never sets / clears it on its own; it affects a single execution only and "
"does not cascade."

#: flowing.agent.FieldUpdate:1 of
msgid "``watch`` watcher 通道的 value——一次实例属性赋值事件的快照。"
msgstr "The value of the ``watch`` watcher channel — a snapshot of one instance attribute assignment event."

#: flowing.agent.FieldUpdate:5 of
msgid ""
"``Agent.__setattr__`` 拦截实例属性赋值时，在写入前构造本对象并以 fire-and-forget 方式通知 watcher "
"通道（``hooks._notify_watch``， pattern 匹配本对象的 ``name`` "
"字段——``agent.watch('locale', ...)`` 即字面量精确匹配）。watcher 收到的是赋值事件的自洽快照：无论 "
"watcher 何时真正执行，``old`` / ``new`` 都是触发那一刻的值。"
msgstr ""
"When ``Agent.__setattr__`` intercepts an instance attribute assignment, it constructs this "
"object before the write and notifies the watcher channel fire-and-forget "
"(``hooks._notify_watch``; the pattern matches this object's ``name`` field — "
"``agent.watch('locale', ...)`` is a literal exact match). What a watcher receives is a "
"self-consistent snapshot of the assignment event: no matter when the watcher actually executes, "
"``old`` / ``new`` are the values at the moment of triggering."

#: flowing.agent.FieldUpdate:13 of
msgid ""
"纯观察：watcher 改写 ``new`` 无效（watcher 返回值被忽略）； ``raise Intercepted`` "
"与普通异常同处理——终止本次 watcher 链、 记录日志，不影响赋值（fire-and-forget 无上抛对象）。"
msgstr ""
"Pure observation: a watcher rewriting ``new`` has no effect (watcher return values are ignored); "
"``raise Intercepted`` is handled like an ordinary exception — it terminates the current watcher "
"chain and is logged, without affecting the assignment (fire-and-forget has no one to propagate "
"to)."

#: flowing.agent.FieldUpdate:16 of
msgid "watcher 可为同步或异步函数（后台任务统一 await）。"
msgstr "A watcher may be a sync or async function (uniformly awaited in the background task)."

#: flowing.agent.FieldUpdate:17 of
msgid ""
"时序不保证：通知任务在写入前入队，但 watcher 的实际执行可能晚于 写入完成；连续多次赋值的多个 watcher 间执行顺序亦不保证——依赖"
" 时序的逻辑应自行序列化，快照数据始终自洽。"
msgstr ""
"Timing is not guaranteed: the notification task is enqueued before the write, but a watcher's "
"actual execution may happen after the write completes; the execution order among watchers of "
"consecutive assignments is likewise not guaranteed — logic that depends on timing should "
"serialize itself; the snapshot data is always self-consistent."

#: flowing.agent.FieldUpdate:20 of
msgid ""
"无运行中的 event loop 时（如 ``__init__`` 骨架阶段的赋值），通知 静默跳过——赋值照常，watcher 不触发。这是 "
"fire-and-forget 的已知 边界。"
msgstr ""
"With no running event loop (e.g. assignments during the ``__init__`` skeleton phase), the "
"notification is silently skipped — the assignment proceeds and no watcher fires. This is a "
"known boundary of fire-and-forget."

#: flowing.agent.FieldUpdate:23 of
msgid "触发范围：仅实例属性赋值；描述符 / 类属性 / ``_`` 前缀骨架字段的 初始化不经过本机制。"
msgstr "Trigger scope: instance attribute assignment only; initialization of descriptors / class attributes / ``_``-prefixed skeleton fields does not go through this mechanism."

#: flowing.agent.FieldUpdate:25 of
msgid "watcher 内再次给同名字段赋值会造成递归通知——框架不做递归防护， 属编程错误。"
msgstr "Assigning to the same-named field again inside a watcher causes recursive notification — the framework has no recursion guard; doing so is a programming error."

#: flowing.agent.FieldUpdate:27 of
msgid ""
"插件约定：托管变量（如 i18n 插件注入的 ``agent.i18n``）应以插件 自有对象为载体，属性级拦截在该对象自己的类里实现；顶层槽位的"
" 重绑定只能经 ``watch`` 观察、不能拦截（可纠正性回写会二次触发 监听）。"
msgstr ""
"Plugin convention: managed variables (e.g. ``agent.i18n`` injected by the i18n plugin) should "
"be carried by the plugin's own object, with attribute-level interception implemented in that "
"object's own class; rebinding of the top-level slot can only be observed via ``watch``, not "
"intercepted (a corrective write-back would trigger the watch a second time)."

#: flowing.agent.FieldUpdate:34 of
msgid ":meth:`Agent.watch` —— ``(new, old)`` 形态的注册糖。"
msgstr ":meth:`Agent.watch` — the registration sugar of the ``(new, old)`` form."

#: flowing.agent.FieldUpdate:35 of
msgid ":meth:`flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.watch` —— 低层注册 （``(agent, value)`` 形态）。"
msgstr ":meth:`flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.watch` — the low-level registration (the ``(agent, value)`` form)."

#: flowing.FieldUpdate.name:1 flowing.agent.FieldUpdate.name:1 of
msgid "被赋值的字段名；watcher 注册的 pattern 按本字段匹配。"
msgstr "The name of the field being assigned; the pattern a watcher registers matches against this field."

#: flowing.FieldUpdate.old:1 flowing.agent.FieldUpdate.old:1 of
msgid "旧值；字段此前不存在时为 ``None``。"
msgstr "The old value; ``None`` if the field did not exist before."

#: flowing.FieldUpdate.new:1 flowing.agent.FieldUpdate.new:1 of
msgid "即将写入的值（快照，只读语义——改写不影响赋值）。"
msgstr "The value about to be written (a snapshot with read-only semantics — rewriting it does not affect the assignment)."

#: flowing.tool.File:1 of
msgid "工具返回文件时使用的媒体载体——与 `Image` 同构。"
msgstr "The media carrier used when a tool returns a file — isomorphic to `Image`."

#: flowing.tool.File:3 of
msgid ""
"显式推翻推断的通道：``File(path=\"x.png\")`` 强制产 ``FileBlock`` 而非 "
"``ImageBlock``。字段语义与校验规则见 `Image`。"
msgstr ""
"The channel for explicitly overriding inference: ``File(path=\"x.png\")`` forces a "
"``FileBlock`` instead of an ``ImageBlock``. For field semantics and validation rules see `Image`."

#: flowing.message.FileBlock:1 of
msgid "文件内容块（不直接可读的二进制或大型结构化数据）。"
msgstr "A file content block (binary or large structured data that is not directly readable)."

#: flowing.message.FileBlock:5 of
msgid ""
"与 tool_call 无绑定关系的文件载体——一条 USER 消息可同时含 ``text`` 与多个 ``file`` "
"block。与媒体块的区别在意图：用户上传图片但只希望 作为文件处理（不做图像识别）时用 ``file``；tool 结果附带的产物文件 "
"亦可直接出现于 TOOL 消息 content（摊平形态，如 ``[struct, file]``）。"
msgstr ""
"A file carrier with no binding to a tool_call — one USER message may contain ``text`` and "
"multiple ``file`` blocks at once. The difference from media blocks is intent: when the user "
"uploads an image but wants it handled as a file only (no image recognition), use ``file``; "
"artifact files attached to a tool result may likewise appear directly in a TOOL message's "
"content (flattened form, e.g. ``[struct, file]``)."

#: flowing.message.FileBlock:12 of
msgid ""
"``name`` 必填（文件名是文件块的核心元数据）；``data`` base64 必填 （路径引用模式不存在）；``mime_type`` "
"可选。"
msgstr ""
"``name`` is required (the file name is the core metadata of a file block); base64 ``data`` is "
"required (there is no path-reference mode); ``mime_type`` is optional."

#: flowing.message.FileBlock:14 of
msgid ""
"adapter 映射示例：Anthropic 转文本引用或 ``document`` API；OpenAI 经 ``file`` "
"attachment / ``data`` content part。"
msgstr ""
"Adapter mapping examples: Anthropic → a text reference or the ``document`` API; OpenAI → via "
"the ``file`` attachment / ``data`` content part."

#: flowing.message.FileBlock:18 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.message.MediaBlock`、 :class:`flowing.message.StructBlock`。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.message.MediaBlock`, :class:`flowing.message.StructBlock`."

#: flowing.FileBlock.type:1 flowing.message.FileBlock.type:1 of
msgid "固定为 ``\"file\"``。"
msgstr "Fixed to ``\"file\"``."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:1 of
msgid "``finish`` —— 子 Agent 结构化交卷工具（普通工具，显式绑定）。"
msgstr "``finish`` — the structured answer-submission tool for subagents (a normal tool, explicitly bound)."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:5 of
msgid ""
"LLM 主动调用 ``finish`` 以结束子 Agent 当前逻辑 Turn 并返回结构化 结果。工具级 ``definition`` "
"只有骨架参数 ``summary``；真正的结构化 返回字段来自 Agent ``tools:`` 条目中的 ``output:`` "
"声明——该声明 展开为 ``finish`` 的额外参数（见使用示例）。"
msgstr ""
"The LLM actively calls ``finish`` to end the subagent's current logical Turn and return a "
"structured result. The tool-level ``definition`` has only the skeleton parameter ``summary``; "
"the real structured return fields come from the ``output:`` declaration in the Agent's "
"``tools:`` entry — that declaration expands into extra parameters of ``finish`` (see the "
"examples)."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:10 of
msgid ""
"不调用 ``finish`` 是子 Agent 的最常用法：回合自然结束时，其 plain "
"文本回复（``last_result``）即作为结果回传亲代 Agent——``finish`` 只是 给想结构化提前交卷的子 Agent "
"一个可选出口，不是必备能力。"
msgstr ""
"Not calling ``finish`` is the most common usage of a subagent: when the turn ends naturally, "
"its plain-text reply (``last_result``) is passed back to the parent Agent as the result — "
"``finish`` is merely an optional exit for subagents that want to submit a structured answer "
"early, not a required capability."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:36 of
msgid ""
"动态 schema 机制：``output`` 走 :class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry` 的 "
"``override_params``——框架核心不感知 ``output`` 的含义，它只是 普通覆写字段；动态 schema 不修改 "
":class:`flowing.tool.ToolRegistry` 原始定义（``clone_with_overrides`` 语义保证）。"
msgstr ""
"The dynamic schema mechanism: ``output`` goes through :class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry`'s "
"``override_params`` — the framework core is unaware of what ``output`` means; it is just an "
"ordinary override field; the dynamic schema never modifies the original definition in "
":class:`flowing.tool.ToolRegistry` (guaranteed by ``clone_with_overrides`` semantics)."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:40 of
msgid ""
"``output`` 字段与 ``finish`` 自身参数合并（``summary`` 与 ``output`` 字段），对 "
"``llm_definition()`` / ``resolve()`` 透明； ``output`` 本身不是 LLM 可见参数。"
msgstr ""
"The ``output`` fields merge with ``finish``'s own parameters (``summary`` and the ``output`` "
"fields), transparent to ``llm_definition()`` / ``resolve()``; ``output`` itself is not an "
"LLM-visible parameter."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:43 of
msgid "无 ``output`` 声明 → 只有 ``summary``，LLM 以自由文本结束。"
msgstr "Without an ``output`` declaration → only ``summary``; the LLM ends with free text."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:44 of
msgid ""
"``output:`` 与 ``args:`` 在 ``ToolEntry`` 内合并进同一 "
"``override_params``；``output`` 覆写是任意工具的通用字段（与 ``args:`` "
"平级）——省略字段即移除，改变类型即覆写，无需完整 重声明。"
msgstr ""
"``output:`` and ``args:`` merge into the same ``override_params`` inside a ``ToolEntry``; the "
"``output`` override is a generic field for any tool (on par with ``args:``) — omitting a field "
"removes it, changing a type overrides it, with no need to redeclare it in full."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:48 of
msgid ""
"可见性走通用通道：``finish`` 对 LLM 可见只经 ``.fya`` ``tools:`` 声明或显式 "
"``add_tool(\"finish\")``。"
msgstr ""
"Visibility goes through the generic channel: ``finish`` becomes visible to the LLM only via a "
"``.fya`` ``tools:`` declaration or an explicit ``add_tool(\"finish\")``."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:50 of
msgid ""
"结束机制：调用后，本回合在其余并行工具调用照常执行完后自然结束， 返回载荷写入 ``Agent.last_result`` 并作为结果回传亲代 "
"Agent；配对 TOOL 消息正常挂树，本回合的回合结束标记（``turn_end=True``）落在 该消息上。"
msgstr ""
"Ending mechanism: after the call, this turn ends naturally once the remaining parallel tool "
"calls finish executing as usual; the return payload is written into ``Agent.last_result`` and "
"passed back to the parent Agent as the result; the paired TOOL message is attached to the tree "
"normally, and this turn's end mark (``turn_end=True``) lands on that message."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:57 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry` —— 覆写数据载体。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry` — the override data carrier."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:58 of
msgid ":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool` —— 显式绑定入口。"
msgstr ":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool` — the explicit binding entry point."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool.execute:1 of
msgid "收集结构化返回字段并结束子 Agent 当前逻辑 Turn。"
msgstr "Collect the structured return fields and end the subagent's current logical Turn."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool.execute:5 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``kwargs`` 接收 ``output:`` 声明展开的动态字段；返回 ``{\"summary\": ..., **动态字段}``——无 "
"``output`` 声明时 ``summary`` 的值即自由文本字符串，声明后值换为结构化字段集， 返回结构本身不变。"
msgstr ""
"``kwargs`` receives the dynamic fields expanded from the ``output:`` declaration; returns "
"``{\"summary\": ..., **dynamic_fields}`` — without an ``output`` declaration the value of "
"``summary`` is a free-text string; with the declaration the value becomes the structured field "
"set, while the return structure itself is unchanged."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool.execute:9 of
msgid ""
"结束机制：同一载荷置位 ``caller.current_turn.finish_output`` ——置位即请求本回合自然结束（视同 "
"``finish=True``，工具段照常 执行完），载荷由子 Agent 收尾段写入 ``Agent.last_result`` 并 "
"作为结果回传亲代 Agent。"
msgstr ""
"Ending mechanism: the same payload sets ``caller.current_turn.finish_output`` — setting it "
"requests this turn to end naturally (treated as ``finish=True``; the tool phase still finishes "
"as usual); the payload is written into ``Agent.last_result`` by the subagent's wrap-up phase "
"and passed back to the parent Agent as the result."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool.execute:13 of
msgid "前置：``caller.current_turn`` 非 ``None`` （工具只在回合内执行）。"
msgstr "Precondition: ``caller.current_turn`` is not ``None`` (tools execute only inside a turn)."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool.execute:15 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` —— 逻辑 Turn 执行期对象。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` — the execution-period object of a logical Turn."

#: flowing.errors.FlowingError:1 of
msgid "框架统一异常根。"
msgstr "The unified root of framework exceptions."

#: flowing.errors.FlowingError:5 of
msgid ""
"Flowing 框架抛出的全部具名异常（``Intercepted`` 除外）的共同基类。应用层用 ``except FlowingError``"
" 可以一网打尽框架错误，而不会误捕 Python 内置异常与 第三方库异常。"
msgstr ""
"The common base class of all named exceptions raised by the Flowing framework (except "
"``Intercepted``). At the application layer, ``except FlowingError`` catches every framework "
"error in one net without accidentally catching Python builtin or third-party library exceptions."

#: flowing.errors.FlowingError:11 of
msgid "本类不定义构造参数与字段；各子类自行定义结构化字段。"
msgstr "This class defines no constructor parameters or fields; each subclass defines its own structured fields."

#: flowing.errors.FlowingError:12 of
msgid ""
"框架不会把第三方库异常静默包装为本类后重抛：Provider adapter 必须显式 归类为 ``ProviderError`` "
"的具体子类后抛出。"
msgstr ""
"The framework never silently wraps a third-party library exception into this class and rethrows "
"it: a Provider adapter must explicitly classify it into a concrete subclass of "
"``ProviderError`` before raising."

#: flowing.errors.FlowingError:14 of
msgid "``Intercepted`` 刻意不继承本类——它是钩子 handler 的有意硬阻断信号， 捕获框架错误时不会误捕它。"
msgstr "``Intercepted`` deliberately does not inherit from this class — it is an intentional hard-blocking signal from hook handlers, and catching framework errors will not accidentally catch it."

#: flowing.errors.FlowingError:19 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted`"

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:1 of
msgid "script 工具的作者基类——类属性声明 + 框架自动生成 `ToolDefinition`。"
msgstr "The author-facing base class for script tools — class-attribute declarations + framework-generated `ToolDefinition`."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:5 of
msgid ""
"工具作者不直接构造 `ToolDefinition`，而是在子类上声明 ``name`` / ``description`` / "
"``args_model`` 类属性；``__init__`` 时 框架自动生成 ``self.definition``。``name`` "
"**必填**（不由类名 kebab 推断——ScriptTool 禁止没有 name 字段）；手写子类须类体 显式 ``name``（或显式 "
"``definition``），``.fya`` / ``.py`` 文件通道的 规范名 = 文件身份（文件名/目录名，加载层注入，类体显式 "
"``name`` 与 文件身份不符抛 :class:`flowing.errors.NameMismatchError`）。 "
"``args_model`` 可省略——从 ``execute()`` 签名的类型标注与默认值构建 模型。"
msgstr ""
"Tool authors do not construct a `ToolDefinition` directly; instead they declare the class "
"attributes ``name`` / ``description`` / ``args_model`` on a subclass, and at ``__init__`` the "
"framework generates ``self.definition`` automatically. ``name`` is **required** (it is not "
"inferred by kebab-casing the class name — a ScriptTool without a name field is forbidden): a "
"handwritten subclass must declare ``name`` explicitly in the class body (or provide an explicit "
"``definition``); for the ``.fya`` / ``.py`` file channels the canonical name = the file "
"identity (file name / directory name, injected by the loading layer; a class-body ``name`` that "
"disagrees with the file identity raises :class:`flowing.errors.NameMismatchError`). "
"``args_model`` may be omitted — the model is built from the type annotations and default "
"values of the ``execute()`` signature."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:15 of
msgid ""
"script 工具共有三条等价的定义通道：手写本类子类（主路径）； ``@flowing_tool`` "
"打标函数（框架自动提升为等价子类）；``.fya`` 的 ``callable:`` 指针指向裸函数。规范名来源：手写通道 = 类体显式 "
"``name``（必填）；文件通道（``.fya`` / ``.py`` / 打标函数）= 文件名 / "
"目录名身份（声明面权威，加载层注入）。``description`` 按显式声明 > 类 docstring 整体 > ``execute()``"
" docstring 整体的三级回退链取。"
msgstr ""
"There are three equivalent definition channels for script tools: handwriting a subclass of "
"this class (the main path); a function tagged with ``@flowing_tool`` (automatically promoted "
"by the framework to an equivalent subclass); and a ``callable:`` pointer in ``.fya`` pointing "
"at a bare function. Sources of the canonical name: the handwritten channel = the explicit "
"class-body ``name`` (required); the file channels (``.fya`` / ``.py`` / tagged function) = the "
"file-name / directory-name identity (authoritative on the declaration side, injected by the "
"loading layer). ``description`` is taken from a three-level fallback chain: explicit "
"declaration > the class docstring as a whole > the ``execute()`` docstring as a whole."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:45 of
msgid ""
"后台工具形态（async generator）：``execute`` 写成 async generator—— 第一个 ``yield`` "
"是「准备完成」标记（可空值），`Tool.__call__` 等待它 作为 ``pending`` "
"收据（``tool_status=\"pending\"`` 的 TOOL 消息带内容）； 后续每个 ``yield`` 由框架后台驱动并逐段投递"
" EVENT 消息（LLM 可见）； 首 yield 前只允许轻量准备，长任务必须放在首 yield 之后（违反的后果 "
"是收据延迟——作者责任）。「只要后台、不要中间报告」的普通 async ``execute`` 可声明类属性 ``background = "
"True`` （仅 script 型生效）走 同一 ``pending`` 通道："
msgstr ""
"The background-tool form (async generator): write ``execute`` as an async generator — the "
"first ``yield`` is a 'preparation done' mark (may be an empty value), and `Tool.__call__` "
"awaits it as the ``pending`` receipt (a TOOL message with ``tool_status=\"pending\"`` carrying "
"content); each subsequent ``yield`` is driven in the background by the framework and delivered "
"piece by piece as EVENT messages (LLM-visible); only lightweight preparation is allowed before "
"the first yield — long tasks must go after the first yield (the consequence of violating this "
"is a delayed receipt — the author's responsibility). A plain async ``execute`` that wants "
"'background only, no intermediate reports' may declare the class attribute ``background = "
"True`` (effective only for the script form) to go through the same ``pending`` channel:"

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:63 of
msgid ""
"async generator 禁止带值 ``return`` （PEP 525 只允许裸 ``return``） ——最终呈现 = 最后一条 "
"``yield``；没有 ``yield`` 的函数不是 async generator（走普通执行路径）；``background = "
"True`` 只对普通 async ``execute`` （单次返回）生效，async gen 无需标记。"
msgstr ""
"An async generator must not ``return`` with a value (PEP 525 allows only a bare ``return``) — "
"the final result = the last ``yield``; a function without any ``yield`` is not an async "
"generator (it takes the normal execution path); ``background = True`` takes effect only for a "
"plain async ``execute`` (single return); an async gen needs no mark."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:70 of
msgid ""
"互斥规则：类属性声明（``name`` / ``description`` / ``args_model``） 与手写 "
"``definition`` 类属性互斥；同时存在时框架发警告，以显式 ``definition`` 为准。"
msgstr ""
"Mutual-exclusion rule: the class-attribute declarations (``name`` / ``description`` / "
"``args_model``) are mutually exclusive with a handwritten ``definition`` class attribute; when "
"both exist the framework emits a warning and the explicit ``definition`` wins."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:73 of
msgid ""
"声明通道互斥：``callable:`` 指向的函数不允许带 ``@flowing_tool`` 装饰（打标 = "
"自动提升通道，``callable:`` = 显式指针通道，二选一）； 违反抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError`。"
msgstr ""
"Declaration-channel exclusion: a function pointed to by ``callable:`` must not carry the "
"``@flowing_tool`` decorator (tagging = the auto-promotion channel, ``callable:`` = the explicit "
"pointer channel; pick one); a violation raises :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError`."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:76 of
msgid "script 工具注册为全局单例（Runtime 一份，所有 Agent 共享）——同一 份用户代码不应实例化多次。"
msgstr "A script tool is registered as a global singleton (one per Runtime, shared by all Agents) — the same piece of user code should not be instantiated multiple times."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:78 of
msgid ""
"每个 ``.py`` 文件至多一个打标函数；与 Tool 子类同文件并存或含多个 打标函数 → "
":class:`flowing.errors.AmbiguousToolError` （定向查找阶段 判别）。"
msgstr ""
"Each ``.py`` file may contain at most one tagged function; coexisting with a Tool subclass in "
"the same file, or containing multiple tagged functions → "
":class:`flowing.errors.AmbiguousToolError` (discriminated at the targeted-lookup phase)."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:81 of
msgid "类属性在 ``__init__`` 前已就绪，无时序问题。"
msgstr "Class attributes are ready before ``__init__``; there is no timing issue."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:83 of
msgid "既无 ``args_model`` 声明、 ``execute()`` 参数又缺类型标注时（签名构建不出字段类型）。"
msgstr "When neither an ``args_model`` declaration exists nor the ``execute()`` parameters have type annotations (the signature cannot yield field types)."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:85 of
msgid ""
"文件通道（``.fya`` / ``.py`` 加载）类体显式 ``name`` 与文件身份（文件名/目录名）不符时（防错位）； "
"手写直接构造通道无此错误（``name`` 缺失抛 :class:`flowing.errors.MissingFieldError`）。"
msgstr ""
"In the file channels (``.fya`` / ``.py`` loading), when the explicit class-body ``name`` "
"disagrees with the file identity (file name / directory name) (a guard against misalignment); "
"the handwritten direct-construction channel has no such error (a missing ``name`` raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingFieldError`)."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:92 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.tool.flowing_tool` —— 打标函数通道。"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.tool.flowing_tool` — the tagged-function channel."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:93 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.tool._infer_from_execute` —— 签名推断的内部实现。"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.tool._infer_from_execute` — the internal implementation of signature inference."

#: flowing.tool.ScriptTool:94 flowing.tool.ToolDefinition:46 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.params` —— 声明层规则与桥接子集。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.params` — the declaration-layer rules and the bridging subset."

#: flowing.ScriptTool.name:1 flowing.tool.ScriptTool.name:1 of
msgid ""
"规范工具名（kebab-case）。**必填**（不由类名 kebab 化推断）：手写子类须类体显式声明；``.fya`` / ``.py`` "
"文件通道由加载层 以文件身份（文件名/目录名）注入，类体显式 ``name`` 与文件身份不符抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.NameMismatchError`；与显式 ``definition`` 互斥。"
msgstr ""
"The canonical tool name (kebab-case). **Required** (not inferred by kebab-casing the class "
"name): a handwritten subclass must declare it explicitly in the class body; for the ``.fya`` / "
"``.py`` file channels the loading layer injects it from the file identity (file name / "
"directory name), and a class-body ``name`` disagreeing with the file identity raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.NameMismatchError`; mutually exclusive with an explicit ``definition``."

#: flowing.ScriptTool.description:1 flowing.tool.ScriptTool.description:1 of
msgid ""
"工具描述。类属性声明；缺省时按三级回退链取：显式 ``description`` > 类 docstring **整体** > "
"``execute()`` docstring **整体**。"
msgstr ""
"The tool description. Declared as a class attribute; when omitted it is taken from a "
"three-level fallback chain: explicit ``description`` > the class docstring **as a whole** > "
"the ``execute()`` docstring **as a whole**."

#: flowing.ScriptTool.args_model:1 flowing.tool.ScriptTool.args_model:1 of
msgid ""
"参数声明：Pydantic ``BaseModel`` 子类，声明即模型——LLM schema 由 "
"``model_json_schema()`` 派生、执行校验即模型本身；``None`` 时由 "
"``_infer_from_execute(self.execute)`` 从签名构建模型。"
msgstr ""
"Parameter declaration: a Pydantic ``BaseModel`` subclass — the declaration is the model: the "
"LLM schema is derived from ``model_json_schema()`` and execution-time validation is the model "
"itself; when ``None``, a model is built from the signature by "
"``_infer_from_execute(self.execute)``."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry:1 of
msgid "Agent 实例级的钩子点注册表。"
msgstr "The per-Agent-instance registry of hook points."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry:5 of
msgid ""
"每个 Agent 实例在 ``__init__`` 中创建一个独立实例（``agent.hooks``）， "
"构造时预填全部核心钩子点（``by=\"core\"``，全集见模块 docstring 的两张 表）；扩展经 :meth:`declare` 在"
" ``setup()`` 阶段就地声明自己的钩子点。"
msgstr ""
"Each Agent instance creates an independent instance in ``__init__`` (``agent.hooks``), "
"pre-filled at construction with all core hook points (``by=\"core\"``; for the full set see "
"the two tables in the module docstring); extensions declare their own hook points in place "
"during the ``setup()`` phase via :meth:`declare`."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry:9 of
msgid ""
"钩子只影响当前 Agent 实例，无全局钩子表——同类的两个 Agent 可以有 不同的钩子栈。钩子点集合是显式的：访问未声明的钩子点立即抛 "
"``UnknownHookPointError`` （而非静默创建空钩子点），让「没调用 ``use_skill()`` 却访问 "
"``before_skill_load``」这类错误在开发期暴露。"
msgstr ""
"Hooks affect only the current Agent instance; there is no global hook table — two Agents of "
"the same class may have different hook stacks. The hook-point set is explicit: accessing an "
"undeclared hook point immediately raises ``UnknownHookPointError`` (instead of silently "
"creating an empty hook point), so mistakes like 'accessing ``before_skill_load`` without ever "
"calling ``use_skill()``' surface at development time."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry:28 of
msgid "钩子点集合只在两处写入：``__init__`` 预填核心点、 :meth:`declare` 声明扩展点；任何其他路径不得写入。"
msgstr "The hook-point set is written in exactly two places: ``__init__`` pre-fills the core points, and :meth:`declare` declares extension points; no other path may write to it."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry:30 of
msgid ""
"属性访问（``hooks.<name>``）经 ``__getattr__`` 只查找不创建： 未声明 → "
":class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`。"
msgstr ""
"Attribute access (``hooks.<name>``) goes through ``__getattr__`` and only looks up, never "
"creates: undeclared → :class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry:32 of
msgid ""
"预填的核心钩子点是 :class:`HookList` 实例，初始不含 handler； ``match_on`` 默认为 "
"``\"name\"``，仅 ``after_provider_gen`` 与 ``on_provider_delta`` 为 "
"``\"by\"`` （value 携带来源标记，可按来源 pattern 过滤注册）。"
msgstr ""
"The pre-filled core hook points are :class:`HookList` instances, initially without handlers; "
"``match_on`` defaults to ``\"name\"``; only ``after_provider_gen`` and "
"``on_provider_delta`` use ``\"by\"`` (their values carry an origin mark, so registration can "
"be filtered by an origin pattern)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry:36 of
msgid "不变量：同一钩子点名在注册表内唯一（声明独占，见 :meth:`declare`）。"
msgstr "Invariant: a hook-point name is unique within the registry (declaration is exclusive; see :meth:`declare`)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry:40 of
msgid ""
":class:`HookList`、 :class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`、 "
":class:`flowing.errors.DuplicateHookPointError`"
msgstr ""
":class:`HookList`, :class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`, "
":class:`flowing.errors.DuplicateHookPointError`"

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.declare:1 of
msgid "声明一个新钩子点（声明独占、注册开放）。"
msgstr "Declare a new hook point (declaration is exclusive; registration is open)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.declare:5 of
msgid ""
"扩展（Composable / 插件的 ``use_xxx``）在 Agent 实例的 ``setup()`` "
"阶段就地声明自己的钩子点，并自行在使用处 dispatch。"
msgstr ""
"Extensions (Composables / plugins' ``use_xxx``) declare their own hook points in place during "
"the Agent instance's ``setup()`` phase, and dispatch them themselves at the use sites."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.declare:8 of
msgid ""
"钩子点从「核心固定集」变为「声明即创建」：Skill 扩展声明 ``before_skill_load``，Comm 扩展声明 "
"``on_signal``——不调用这些 扩展的 Agent 实例没有这些钩子点。声明者是钩子点「所有者」， "
"注册者是「使用者」；声明后任何代码都可挂 handler，无需再声明。"
msgstr ""
"Hook points change from 'a fixed core set' to 'created on declaration': the Skill extension "
"declares ``before_skill_load``, the Comm extension declares ``on_signal`` — Agent instances "
"that never use these extensions do not have these hook points. The declarer is the hook "
"point's 'owner' and registrants are 'users'; once declared, any code may attach handlers "
"without declaring again."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.declare:26 of
msgid "``by`` 为必填关键字参数——框架核心 ``by=\"core\"``，扩展用自身标识； 不允许省略或传 ``None``。"
msgstr "``by`` is a required keyword argument — the framework core uses ``by=\"core\"``, extensions use their own identifier; omitting it or passing ``None`` is not allowed."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.declare:28 of
msgid "同名 + 同 ``by``：幂等，返回已有 ``HookList`` （``match_on`` 以首次声明为准，不校验后续传参是否一致）。"
msgstr "Same name + same ``by``: idempotent — returns the existing ``HookList`` (``match_on`` follows the first declaration; later arguments are not checked for consistency)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.declare:30 of
msgid ""
"同名 + 不同 ``by``：抛 :class:`flowing.errors.DuplicateHookPointError`，消息含双方 "
"``by``。"
msgstr ""
"Same name + different ``by``: raises :class:`flowing.errors.DuplicateHookPointError`, with "
"both ``by`` values in the message."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.declare:33 of
msgid "返回的 ``HookList`` 由声明者自行 dispatch；框架不会代 dispatch 扩展钩子点（谁声明谁 dispatch）。"
msgstr "The returned ``HookList`` is dispatched by the declarer itself; the framework never dispatches extension hook points on anyone's behalf (whoever declares, dispatches)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.declare:35 of
msgid ""
"声明时机约束：应在 ``setup()`` （或 ``use_xxx``）中完成；运行期 Turn "
"循环内声明虽不禁止，但属扩展自身责任，框架不做时序保障。"
msgstr ""
"Declaration-timing constraint: should be done inside ``setup()`` (or ``use_xxx``); declaring "
"inside a runtime Turn loop is not forbidden, but it is the extension's own responsibility — "
"the framework gives no timing guarantee."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.declare:37 of
msgid ""
"``@on`` 冲刷：创建钩子点（而非走「同名同 by 幂等返回已有」路径）时，把 ``_pending_on`` 里同名记录全部挂载进新 "
"``HookList`` （含 pattern 的走 ``HookList[pattern]`` 通道）并从暂记列表移除——此刻尚无其它 "
"handler，``@on`` handler 天然排最前。幂等路径（同名 + 同 ``by``） 不冲刷——首次声明时已结算。"
msgstr ""
"``@on`` flushing: when a hook point is created (rather than taking the 'same name and same "
"``by`` idempotently returns the existing one' path), all same-named records in "
"``_pending_on`` are attached into the new ``HookList`` (those with a pattern go through the "
"``HookList[pattern]`` channel) and removed from the pending list — since no other handlers "
"exist yet, ``@on`` handlers naturally come first. The idempotent path (same name + same "
"``by``) does not flush — it was already settled at the first declaration."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.declare:43 of
msgid "同名钩子点已被不同 ``by`` 声明。"
msgstr "A hook point of the same name has already been declared with a different ``by``."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.declare:48 of
msgid ""
":class:`HookList`、:meth:`HookList.dispatch`、 "
"``flowing.plugins.skills.use_skill``"
msgstr ""
":class:`HookList`, :meth:`HookList.dispatch`, "
"``flowing.plugins.skills.use_skill``"

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.watch:1 of
msgid "注册一个 watcher（不是普通钩子点）。"
msgstr "Register a watcher (not a normal hook point)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.watch:5 of
msgid ""
"与 ``Agent.watch`` 对应的低层注册入口：把 ``(agent, value)`` 形态的 handler 存入 watcher "
"通道。watcher 由 ``_notify_watch`` 以 fire-and-forget 方式触发，与普通钩子不同：不参与改写 / "
"``Intercepted`` / ``shortcut``，返回值被忽略，异常只记录日志。"
msgstr ""
"The low-level registration entry point corresponding to ``Agent.watch``: stores a handler of "
"the ``(agent, value)`` form into the watcher channel. Watchers are triggered by "
"``_notify_watch`` fire-and-forget; unlike normal hooks, they do not participate in rewriting / "
"``Intercepted`` / ``shortcut``, their return values are ignored, and exceptions are only "
"logged."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.watch:10 of
msgid "fnmatch pattern，匹配 ``value.name`` 字段。"
msgstr "An fnmatch pattern, matched against the ``value.name`` field."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.watch:11 of
msgid "``(agent, value) -> None`` （同步或异步均可）。"
msgstr "``(agent, value) -> None`` (sync or async both work)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookRegistry.watch:12 of
msgid "handler（便于装饰器写法）。"
msgstr "The handler (convenient for the decorator style)."

#: flowing.tool.Image:1 of
msgid "工具返回图片时使用的媒体载体（消息层 Block 对工具作者透明）。"
msgstr "The media carrier used when a tool returns an image (message-layer Blocks are transparent to tool authors)."

#: flowing.tool.Image:5 of
msgid ""
"工具作者通常不需要本载体：``execute`` 直接返回裸 ``bytes`` 或 ``pathlib.Path`` 即可，框架自动推断 "
"MIME 与文件名并转为消息层的 ``ImageBlock``。需要显式指定 MIME、文件名，或推翻推断结果（如 "
"``File(path=\"x.png\")`` 强制文件块而非图片块）时才构造本载体。 第三方库对象（如 "
"``PIL.Image.Image``）也直接返回，经 :func:`register_media_converter` "
"注册的转换器处理。工具作者接口面 不出现消息层 Block——载体 → 块的转换只发生在 "
":func:`flowing.tool.normalize_output` （async，可能读盘）。"
msgstr ""
"Tool authors usually do not need this carrier: ``execute`` may return bare ``bytes`` or a "
"``pathlib.Path`` directly, and the framework infers the MIME and file name automatically and "
"converts them into a message-layer ``ImageBlock``. Construct this carrier only when you need "
"to specify the MIME or file name explicitly, or to override the inference (e.g. "
"``File(path=\"x.png\")`` forcing a file block instead of an image block). Third-party library "
"objects (e.g. ``PIL.Image.Image``) are likewise returned directly and handled by converters "
"registered via :func:`register_media_converter`. Message-layer Blocks never appear on the "
"tool-author interface — carrier → block conversion happens only in "
":func:`flowing.tool.normalize_output` (async, may read from disk)."

#: flowing.tool.Image:16 of
msgid ""
"``data`` 与 ``path`` 至少给其一，都没有 → ``ValueError``； ``path`` 必须是绝对路径，相对路径 → "
"``ValueError`` （作者笔误， 直接上抛，不包成工具结果）。"
msgstr ""
"At least one of ``data`` and ``path`` must be given; neither → ``ValueError``; ``path`` must "
"be absolute — a relative path → ``ValueError`` (an author's slip, propagated directly instead "
"of being wrapped into a tool result)."

#: flowing.tool.Image:19 of
msgid ""
"MIME 推断链：显式 ``mime_type`` > path 后缀（``mimetypes``）> bytes 魔数；``image/*`` "
"→ ``ImageBlock``、``audio/*`` → ``AudioBlock``、``video/*`` → "
"``VideoBlock``、其余或推不出 → ``FileBlock`` （宁文件勿图）。显式载体声明永远压过推断。"
msgstr ""
"The MIME inference chain: explicit ``mime_type`` > path suffix (``mimetypes``) > bytes magic "
"number; ``image/*`` → ``ImageBlock``, ``audio/*`` → ``AudioBlock``, ``video/*`` → "
"``VideoBlock``, anything else or uninferable → ``FileBlock`` (when in doubt, prefer file over "
"image). An explicit carrier declaration always overrides inference."

#: flowing.tool.Image:23 of
msgid ""
"文件名填充链：显式 ``name`` > ``path`` 文件名 > 合成 ``<sha256(data)[:12]>.<ext>`` （ext"
" 由 MIME 反推，MIME 未知 → ``.bin``）。"
msgstr ""
"The file-name fill chain: explicit ``name`` > ``path`` file name > synthesized "
"``<sha256(data)[:12]>.<ext>`` (ext reverse-inferred from the MIME; unknown MIME → ``.bin``)."

#: flowing.tool.Image:29 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.tool.normalize_output` —— 载体 → 块的唯一转换点。"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.tool.normalize_output` — the sole carrier → block conversion point."

#: flowing.tool.Image:30 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.message.ImageBlock` —— 转换产物（消息层）。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.message.ImageBlock` — the conversion product (message layer)."

#: flowing.Image.data:1 flowing.tool.Image.data:1 of
msgid "bytes 原始数据或 str base64；与 ``path`` 至少其一。"
msgstr "Raw bytes data or a base64 str; at least one of this and ``path``."

#: flowing.Image.path:1 flowing.tool.Image.path:1 of
msgid "绝对路径（接受 ``pathlib.Path``）；相对路径 → ``ValueError``。"
msgstr "An absolute path (``pathlib.Path`` accepted); a relative path → ``ValueError``."

#: flowing.Image.mime_type:1 flowing.tool.Image.mime_type:1 of
msgid "显式 MIME；缺省走推断链（见类 docstring 行为要点）。"
msgstr "An explicit MIME; when omitted the inference chain applies (see Key Behaviors in the class docstring)."

#: flowing.Image.name:1 flowing.tool.Image.name:1 of
msgid "文件名；缺省 = path 文件名 > hash.ext 合成（见类 docstring）。"
msgstr "The file name; default = the path file name, else the synthesized hash.ext form (see the class docstring)."

#: flowing.message.ImageBlock:1 of
msgid "图像内容块（单帧静态，多模态视觉输入）。"
msgstr "An image content block (a single static frame, multimodal visual input)."

#: flowing.message.ImageBlock:5 of
msgid ""
"用户上传图片且希望多模态视觉理解时使用；仅作文件传递（不做图像识别） 时用 :class:`FileBlock`。映射：Anthropic "
"``image`` block、OpenAI ``image_url`` content part。"
msgstr ""
"Used when the user uploads an image and wants multimodal visual understanding; when it is only "
"a file transfer (no image recognition), use :class:`FileBlock`. Mapping: Anthropic ``image`` "
"block, OpenAI ``image_url`` content part."

#: flowing.message.ImageBlock:11 of
msgid "字段与 :class:`MediaBlock` 一致；``type`` 固定 ``\"image\"``。"
msgstr "Fields are the same as :class:`MediaBlock`; ``type`` is fixed to ``\"image\"``."

#: flowing.message.ImageBlock:12 of
msgid "框架不校验数据确实是图像（adapter / Provider 负责）。"
msgstr "The framework does not validate that the data really is an image (the adapter / Provider is responsible)."

#: flowing.message.ImageBlock:15 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.message.MediaBlock`、 :class:`flowing.message.VideoBlock`。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.message.MediaBlock`, :class:`flowing.message.VideoBlock`."

#: flowing.ImageBlock.type:1 flowing.message.ImageBlock.type:1 of
msgid "固定为 ``\"image\"``。"
msgstr "Fixed to ``\"image\"``."

#: flowing.params.InjectionKey:1 of
msgid "provide/inject 的类型安全注入键——仅在调用侧提供编译期类型标注。"
msgstr "The type-safe injection key for provide/inject — providing compile-time type annotation at the call side only."

#: flowing.params.InjectionKey:5 of
msgid ""
"``InjectionKey[T]`` 是一个带泛型参数的具名键：``name`` 是运行期唯一 实质内容，``T`` "
"是给类型检查器与读者的「该键应注入什么类型的值」 标注。与裸字符串 key 共存：需要类型安全（共享的 ``keys.py``、框架 "
"插件内部的键定义如 ``communication_key``）用 ``InjectionKey``； "
"简单一次性场景用字符串简写（``inject(\"locale\")``，类型为 ``Any``）。 字符串 key "
"容易拼错、重构不可追踪；泛型键让 ``provide`` / ``inject`` 两侧的值类型在静态检查下对齐。类型信息不跨节点传递：注入存储的"
" key 恒为 ``str``，``inject_from()`` 内部退化为按 ``name`` 匹配，框架 运行期不做任何类型校验。"
msgstr ""
"``InjectionKey[T]`` is a named key with a generic parameter: ``name`` is the only substantive "
"content at runtime, and ``T`` is an annotation for type checkers and readers of 'what type of "
"value this key should inject'. It coexists with bare string keys: use ``InjectionKey`` where "
"type safety is needed (a shared ``keys.py``, key definitions inside framework plugins such as "
"``communication_key``); use the string shorthand for simple one-off scenarios "
"(``inject(\"locale\")``, typed as ``Any``). String keys are easy to misspell and untraceable "
"under refactoring; generic keys let the value types on the ``provide`` / ``inject`` sides "
"align under static checking. Type information does not travel across nodes: the key in the "
"injection store is always a ``str``; ``inject_from()`` internally degrades to matching by "
"``name``, and the framework performs no runtime type validation at all."

#: flowing.params.InjectionKey:38 of
msgid ""
"``name`` 创建后不可变；同一 ``name`` 的 ``InjectionKey`` 与裸 字符串指向注入存储中的同一槽位（同哈希、可互作"
" dict 键）。"
msgstr ""
"``name`` is immutable after creation; an ``InjectionKey`` and a bare string with the same "
"``name`` point at the same slot in the injection store (same hash, mutually usable as dict "
"keys)."

#: flowing.params.InjectionKey:40 of
msgid ""
"``__eq__``：与另一个 ``InjectionKey`` 按 ``name`` 比较，或与裸 ``str`` "
"直接比较；``__hash__`` 等于 ``hash(self.name)``。"
msgstr ""
"``__eq__``: compared with another ``InjectionKey`` by ``name``, or directly with a bare "
"``str``; ``__hash__`` equals ``hash(self.name)``."

#: flowing.params.InjectionKey:42 of
msgid "``__str__`` 返回 ``name``；``__repr__`` 返回 ``InjectionKey(...)`` 调试形态。"
msgstr "``__str__`` returns ``name``; ``__repr__`` returns the ``InjectionKey(...)`` debug form."

#: flowing.params.InjectionKey:44 of
msgid ""
"运行期不做 ``T`` 的类型校验：亲节点 provide 了 ``int``、子按 ``InjectionKey[str]`` inject "
"不会被框架拦截（类型契约是静态的）。 两个泛型参数不同但 ``name`` 相同的键（``InjectionKey[int](\"x\")`` 与"
" ``InjectionKey[str](\"x\")``）在运行期相等且同槽——避免在同一 作用域混用同名异型键，框架不检测这类静态错误。"
msgstr ""
"No runtime type validation of ``T``: if the parent node provided an ``int`` and the child "
"injects via ``InjectionKey[str]``, the framework does not intercept it (the type contract is "
"static). Two keys with different generic parameters but the same ``name`` "
"(``InjectionKey[int](\"x\")`` and ``InjectionKey[str](\"x\")``) are equal at runtime and share "
"the same slot — avoid mixing same-name different-type keys in one scope; the framework does "
"not detect this kind of static error."

#: flowing.params.InjectionKey:49 of
msgid "同 key 重复 ``provide`` 是覆盖更新（后者生效）——冲突处置属 ``provide`` 侧规则，与键类本身无关。"
msgstr "Repeated ``provide`` of the same key is an overwriting update (the later one wins) — conflict handling is a rule of the ``provide`` side, unrelated to the key class itself."

#: flowing.params.InjectionKey:52 of
msgid ""
":class:`ConfigKey` —— 镜像同模式的配置键； :func:`flowing.runtime.inject_from` —— 沿"
" provide 链上溯、按 ``name`` 匹配的执行点；:class:`flowing.provide.ProvideNode` —— "
"注入存储的 key 恒为 ``str`` 的节点协议。"
msgstr ""
":class:`ConfigKey` — the config key mirroring the same pattern; "
":func:`flowing.runtime.inject_from` — the execution point that walks up the provide chain "
"and matches by ``name``; :class:`flowing.provide.ProvideNode` — the node protocol whose "
"injection-store keys are always ``str``."

#: flowing.InjectionKey.name:1 flowing.params.InjectionKey.name:1 of
msgid "键名——运行期唯一实质内容，也是注入存储中的实际 key。创建后不可 变；与同名裸字符串等价（同槽位、同哈希、相等比较一致）。"
msgstr "The key name — the only substantive content at runtime, and the actual key in the injection store. Immutable after creation; equivalent to the same-named bare string (same slot, same hash, consistent equality)."

#: flowing.errors.Intercepted:1 of
msgid "钩子 handler 的有意硬阻断信号（刻意不继承 ``FlowingError``）。"
msgstr "The intentional hard-blocking signal of hook handlers (deliberately not inheriting ``FlowingError``)."

#: flowing.errors.Intercepted:5 of
msgid ""
"handler 的三种合法出口之一（另两种：返回 value、设置 ``shortcut`` 字段 短路）。``raise "
"Intercepted`` 表示「有意的阻止」——审批拒绝、安全阻断、权限 检查等正常业务分支，而不是意外错误。dispatch "
"层捕获本信号后原样重抛：处理 链停止、后续 handler 不执行、对应的 ``after_`` 钩子不触发（整个操作标记为 "
"无效）；不当作错误处理（INFO 级日志，非 ERROR）。``tool_call()`` 路径把本 信号转换为 "
"``ToolResult.blocked(reason)``——LLM 收到 ``tool_status=\"blocked\"``、内容为 "
"``[TextBlock(reason)]`` 的 TOOL 消息。"
msgstr ""
"One of a handler's three legal exits (the other two: returning the value, or setting the "
"``shortcut`` field to short-circuit). ``raise Intercepted`` means 'intentional prevention' — "
"normal business branches such as approval rejection, security blocking, or permission checks, "
"not an accidental error. The dispatch layer catches this signal and rethrows it as-is: the "
"processing chain stops, later handlers do not run, and the corresponding ``after_`` hook does "
"not fire (the whole operation is marked void); it is not treated as an error (INFO-level log, "
"not ERROR). The ``tool_call()`` path converts this signal into "
"``ToolResult.blocked(reason)`` — the LLM receives a TOOL message with "
"``tool_status=\"blocked\"`` and content ``[TextBlock(reason)]``."

#: flowing.errors.Intercepted:13 of
msgid ""
"与 ``shortcut`` 字段的边界：shortcut 是协商式替代（``after_`` 钩子照常 "
"触发），本信号是硬阻断（``after_`` 钩子不触发）。"
msgstr ""
"The boundary with the ``shortcut`` field: shortcut is a negotiated substitution (the "
"``after_`` hook still fires), whereas this signal is a hard block (the ``after_`` hook does "
"not fire)."

#: flowing.errors.Intercepted:32 of
msgid "``reason`` 为阻断原因（面向人读）；``tool_call()`` 路径下进入 LLM 可见的 blocked 结果。"
msgstr "``reason`` is the blocking reason (human-facing); on the ``tool_call()`` path it enters the LLM-visible blocked result."

#: flowing.errors.Intercepted:34 of
msgid "``payload`` 为结构化附加信息，框架不解释其内容，供审计 / 日志消费；默认 ``None``。"
msgstr "``payload`` is structured additional information; the framework does not interpret its content — it is for audit / log consumption; defaults to ``None``."

#: flowing.errors.Intercepted:36 of
msgid "刻意不继承 ``FlowingError``：泛化的 ``except FlowingError`` 不会误吞阻断 信号。"
msgstr "Deliberately does not inherit ``FlowingError``: a broad ``except FlowingError`` will not accidentally swallow the blocking signal."

#: flowing.errors.Intercepted:38 of
msgid "本信号不触发任何错误钩子，也不进入 ``on_provider_error`` 决策树；与重试 无关。"
msgstr "This signal triggers no error hooks and does not enter the ``on_provider_error`` decision tree; it has nothing to do with retries."

#: flowing.errors.Intercepted:40 of
msgid "在「没有对应工具调用」的钩子点（如 ``before_turn``）抛出时，由该操作的 发起路径决定如何呈现，框架不保证统一的 LLM 可见形式。"
msgstr "When raised at a hook point with no corresponding tool call (e.g. ``before_turn``), how it is presented is decided by the initiating path of that operation; the framework guarantees no uniform LLM-visible form."

#: flowing.errors.Intercepted:45 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.hooks.HookList`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.hooks.HookList`"

#: flowing.errors.Intercepted:46 of
msgid "处理链的 dispatch 语义（改写链 / shortcut / 本信号重抛）。"
msgstr "The dispatch semantics of the processing chain (rewrite chain / shortcut / rethrowing this signal)."

#: flowing.errors:145 flowing.errors.Intercepted:47 flowing.hooks:109 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolResult`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolResult`"

#: flowing.errors.Intercepted:48 of
msgid "``ToolResult.blocked(...)`` 的载体。"
msgstr "The carrier of ``ToolResult.blocked(...)``."

#: flowing.Intercepted.reason:1 flowing.errors.Intercepted.reason:1 of
msgid "阻断原因（面向人读）；``tool_call()`` 路径下进入 LLM 可见的 blocked 结果。"
msgstr "The blocking reason (human-facing); on the ``tool_call()`` path it enters the LLM-visible blocked result."

#: flowing.Intercepted.payload:1 flowing.errors.Intercepted.payload:1 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "结构化附加信息（如 ``{\"tool\": ...}``），供审计 / 日志消费；框架不解释其内容。默认 ``None``。"
msgstr "Structured additional information (e.g. ``{\"tool\": ...}``), for audit / log consumption; the framework does not interpret its content. Defaults to ``None``."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList:1 of
msgid "按标签或来源批量管理一组可开关条目的容器。"
msgstr "A container that manages a group of togglable entries in bulk by tag or by origin."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList:5 of
msgid ""
"容器维护一批条目的顺序，提供整组操作：``append`` 追加条目、 ``insert`` 在任意位置插入条目； "
"``disable_by_tag`` / ``enable_by_tag`` / ``remove_by_tag`` 按标签 "
"批量操作；``disable_by_owner`` / ``enable_by_owner`` / ``remove_by_owner`` "
"按来源批量操作；``__iter__`` 按列表顺序产出 当前启用的条目。框架内 :class:`flowing.hooks.HookList` "
"与 :class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList` 以它为基础；使用者也可以 直接使用本类管理自己的条目组。"
msgstr ""
"The container maintains the order of a batch of entries and provides whole-group operations: "
"``append`` appends an entry, ``insert`` inserts an entry at any position; "
"``disable_by_tag`` / ``enable_by_tag`` / ``remove_by_tag`` operate in bulk by tag; "
"``disable_by_owner`` / ``enable_by_owner`` / ``remove_by_owner`` operate in bulk by origin; "
"``__iter__`` yields the currently enabled entries in list order. Inside the framework, "
":class:`flowing.hooks.HookList` and :class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList` are built on it; "
"users may also use this class directly to manage their own entry groups."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList:36 of
msgid "批量操作只作用于当前容器实例，不影响其它容器：每个容器各自 维护自己的条目与状态。"
msgstr "Bulk operations act only on the current container instance and do not affect other containers: each container maintains its own entries and state."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList:38 of
msgid ""
"停用（``disable_*``）只把条目的 ``enabled`` 字段置为 ``False``： "
"条目仍保留在容器中、注册顺序不变，之后调用对应的 ``enable_*`` 可恢复。恢复同样只改字段，不移动条目。"
msgstr ""
"Disabling (``disable_*``) only sets an entry's ``enabled`` field to ``False``: the entry "
"stays in the container with its registration order unchanged, and a later call to the "
"corresponding ``enable_*`` restores it. Restoration likewise only changes the field and does "
"not move the entry."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList:41 of
msgid "删除（``remove_*``）把匹配条目从容器中彻底移除，之后无法恢复。"
msgstr "Removal (``remove_*``) removes matching entries from the container permanently; they cannot be restored afterwards."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList:42 of
msgid "标签匹配：条目的 ``tags`` 列表中任一元素与给定标签相等即命中。"
msgstr "Tag matching: an entry is hit when any element of its ``tags`` list equals the given tag."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList:43 of
msgid ""
"来源匹配：``item.by == owner`` 精确相等；``None`` 与 ``None`` 也相等，因此 "
"``remove_by_owner(None)`` 能命中注册时未提供来源 的条目。"
msgstr ""
"Origin matching: ``item.by == owner`` with exact equality; ``None`` equals ``None`` too, so "
"``remove_by_owner(None)`` hits entries registered without an origin."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList:46 of
msgid "停用与恢复只对状态实际发生变化的条目计数：已处于目标状态的 匹配条目不产生任何变化、不计入返回值，重复调用第二次返回 0。"
msgstr "Disable and restore count only entries whose state actually changes: matching entries already in the target state produce no change and are not counted in the return value; a repeated call returns 0 the second time."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList:48 of
msgid "删除对全部匹配条目计数，与条目当前是否停用无关；没有匹配条目 时返回 0 且容器内容不变。"
msgstr "Removal counts all matching entries regardless of whether an entry is currently disabled; with no matching entries it returns 0 and the container content is unchanged."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList:50 of
msgid ""
"容器内条目的相对顺序由 ``append`` / ``insert`` 共同决定（纯 ``append`` "
"时等于注册顺序），``disable_*`` / ``enable_*`` 不 改变顺序。"
msgstr ""
"The relative order of entries in the container is determined jointly by ``append`` / "
"``insert`` (with pure ``append`` it equals the registration order); ``disable_*`` / "
"``enable_*`` never change the order."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList:54 of
msgid ""
":class:`Togglable`、:class:`flowing.hooks.HookList`、 "
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList`"
msgstr ""
":class:`Togglable`, :class:`flowing.hooks.HookList`, "
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList`"

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.append:1 of
msgid "把一个条目追加到容器末尾，并返回该条目本身。"
msgstr "Append an entry to the end of the container and return the entry itself."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.append:5 of
msgid "追加后条目参与后续的批量操作与迭代。容器内条目的迭代顺序即 注册顺序——框架内钩子分发、上下文组装等消费路径都按这个顺序 处理条目。"
msgstr "Once appended, the entry participates in subsequent bulk operations and iteration. The iteration order of entries in the container is the registration order — consumption paths inside the framework such as hook dispatch and context assembly all process entries in this order."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.append:9 of
msgid "被追加的条目本身，便于链式使用。"
msgstr "The appended entry itself, convenient for chained use."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.append:13 of
msgid "不做去重：同一个条目对象可以多次追加，每次追加都会在容器 中产生一个位置，迭代与批量操作各处理一次。"
msgstr "No deduplication: the same entry object may be appended multiple times; each append produces a position in the container, and iteration and bulk operations each process it once."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.append:15 of
msgid ""
"本方法对子类形态不做约束：子类可把 append 特化为「构造并 追加」的工厂式签名（如 "
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList` 的 ``append(name, content, "
"...)``）；此时基类的元素式 ``append(item)`` 在该子类上不可用，属有意为之。"
msgstr ""
"This method imposes no constraint on subclass shapes: a subclass may specialize append into a "
"factory-style 'construct and append' signature (e.g. "
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList`'s ``append(name, content, ...)``); in that case the "
"base class's element-style ``append(item)`` is unavailable on that subclass — intentionally."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.append:20 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.hooks.HookList`、 :class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.hooks.HookList`, :class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList`"

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.insert:1 of
msgid "把一个条目插入到容器的任意位置，并返回该条目本身。"
msgstr "Insert an entry at any position of the container and return the entry itself."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.insert:5 of
msgid ""
":meth:`append` 的任意位置版本：条目进入 ``index`` 指定的位置， 其后既有条目顺移一位。下标语义同 "
"``list.insert``：负下标从尾部 倒数，越界下标向两端收敛（过小插到最前、过大追加到尾部）。 插入后条目参与后续的批量操作与迭代。"
msgstr ""
"The any-position version of :meth:`append`: the entry goes into the position given by "
"``index``, and the existing entries after it shift one place. Index semantics follow "
"``list.insert``: negative indices count from the tail, and out-of-range indices clamp to the "
"two ends (too small inserts at the front, too large appends at the tail). Once inserted, the "
"entry participates in subsequent bulk operations and iteration."

#: flowing.context.PromptBlockList.insert:21
#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.insert:17 of
msgid "插入位置（可为负，语义同 ``list.insert``）。"
msgstr "The insertion position (may be negative, with the same semantics as ``list.insert``)."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.insert:18 of
msgid "被插入的条目本身，便于链式使用。"
msgstr "The inserted entry itself, convenient for chained use."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.insert:22 of
msgid "插入后容器的条目顺序由 ``append`` 与 ``insert`` 共同决定—— 不再恒等于注册顺序；迭代与消费路径按列表新顺序处理条目。"
msgstr "After insertion, the entry order of the container is determined jointly by ``append`` and ``insert`` — no longer always equal to the registration order; iteration and consumption paths process entries in the new list order."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.insert:24 of
msgid "与 :meth:`append` 一样不做去重：同一个条目对象可多次插入。"
msgstr "Like :meth:`append`, no deduplication: the same entry object may be inserted multiple times."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.insert:25 of
msgid ""
"本方法对子类形态不做约束：子类可把 insert 特化为「构造并 插入」的工厂式签名（如 "
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList` 的 ``insert(index, name, content,"
" ...)``）；此时基类的元素式 ``insert(index, item)`` 在该子类上不可用，属有意为之。"
msgstr ""
"This method imposes no constraint on subclass shapes: a subclass may specialize insert into a "
"factory-style 'construct and insert' signature (e.g. "
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList`'s ``insert(index, name, content, ...)``); in that "
"case the base class's element-style ``insert(index, item)`` is unavailable on that subclass — "
"intentionally."

#: flowing.context.PromptBlockList.insert:39
#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.insert:30 of
msgid ":meth:`append`"
msgstr ":meth:`append`"

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.disable_by_tag:1 of
msgid "把 ``tags`` 列表中含有 ``tag`` 的全部条目从启用改为停用。"
msgstr "Disable all entries whose ``tags`` list contains ``tag``."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.disable_by_tag:3
#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.enable_by_tag:3
#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_tag:3 of
msgid "要匹配的标签；条目的 ``tags`` 列表中任一元素与它 相等即命中。"
msgstr "The tag to match; an entry is hit when any element of its ``tags`` list equals it."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.disable_by_owner:5
#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.disable_by_tag:5 of
msgid "本次实际从启用变为停用的条目数；没有匹配条目时返回 0。"
msgstr "The number of entries actually changed from enabled to disabled by this call; 0 when nothing matches."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.disable_by_tag:9 of
msgid ""
"停用只修改条目的 ``enabled`` 字段（置为 ``False``）：条目仍保留 在容器中、注册顺序不变，之后调用 "
"``enable_by_tag(tag)`` 可恢复。 已处于停用状态的条目不受影响、也不会被本次调用计数：重复调用 同一个 ``tag`` "
"不改变任何状态，第二次调用返回 0。"
msgstr ""
"Disabling only modifies an entry's ``enabled`` field (set to ``False``): the entry stays in "
"the container with its registration order unchanged, and a later ``enable_by_tag(tag)`` "
"restores it. Entries already disabled are unaffected and are not counted by this call: "
"repeating the call with the same ``tag`` changes no state, and the second call returns 0."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.disable_by_tag:14 of
msgid ":meth:`enable_by_tag`、:meth:`remove_by_tag`"
msgstr ":meth:`enable_by_tag`, :meth:`remove_by_tag`"

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.enable_by_tag:1 of
msgid "把 ``tags`` 列表中含有 ``tag`` 的全部停用条目恢复为启用。"
msgstr "Re-enable all disabled entries whose ``tags`` list contains ``tag``."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.enable_by_owner:5
#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.enable_by_tag:5 of
msgid "本次实际从停用变为启用的条目数；没有匹配条目时返回 0。"
msgstr "The number of entries actually changed from disabled to enabled by this call; 0 when nothing matches."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.enable_by_tag:9 of
msgid ""
"恢复只修改条目的 ``enabled`` 字段（置为 ``True``），不移动条目， "
"迭代顺序保持注册顺序。已处于启用状态的条目不受影响、也不会被 本次调用计数：重复调用同一个 ``tag`` 第二次返回 0。"
msgstr ""
"Restoration only modifies an entry's ``enabled`` field (set to ``True``) and never moves the "
"entry; the iteration order stays the registration order. Entries already enabled are "
"unaffected and are not counted by this call: repeating the call with the same ``tag`` returns "
"0 the second time."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.enable_by_tag:13 of
msgid ":meth:`disable_by_tag`、:meth:`remove_by_tag`"
msgstr ":meth:`disable_by_tag`, :meth:`remove_by_tag`"

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_tag:1 of
msgid "把 ``tags`` 列表中含有 ``tag`` 的全部条目从容器中彻底移除。"
msgstr "Permanently remove all entries whose ``tags`` list contains ``tag`` from the container."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_owner:5
#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_tag:5 of
msgid "被移除的条目数；没有匹配条目时返回 0。"
msgstr "The number of entries removed; 0 when nothing matches."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_tag:9 of
msgid ""
"移除是彻底的：条目不再保留在容器中，之后无法经 ``enable_by_tag(tag)`` 恢复。移除对全部匹配条目生效，与条目 "
"当前是否停用无关；没有匹配条目时容器内容不变。"
msgstr ""
"Removal is permanent: the entries no longer stay in the container and cannot be restored "
"afterwards via ``enable_by_tag(tag)``. Removal applies to all matching entries regardless of "
"whether an entry is currently disabled; with no matching entries the container content is "
"unchanged."

#: flowing.context.PromptBlockList.append:44
#: flowing.context.PromptBlockList.enable_by_tag:17
#: flowing.context.PromptBlockList.remove_by_tag:29
#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_tag:13 of
msgid ":meth:`disable_by_tag`"
msgstr ":meth:`disable_by_tag`"

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.disable_by_owner:1 of
msgid "把 ``by`` 与 ``owner`` 相等的全部条目从启用改为停用。"
msgstr "Disable all entries whose ``by`` equals ``owner``."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.disable_by_owner:3
#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.enable_by_owner:3
#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_owner:3 of
msgid "要匹配的来源标识；按 ``item.by == owner`` 精确相等 判断，``None`` 与 ``None`` 也相等。"
msgstr "The origin identifier to match; judged by exact equality ``item.by == owner``, where ``None`` equals ``None`` too."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.disable_by_owner:9 of
msgid ""
"停用只修改条目的 ``enabled`` 字段（置为 ``False``）：条目仍保留 在容器中、注册顺序不变，之后调用 "
"``enable_by_owner(owner)`` 可 恢复。已处于停用状态的条目不受影响、也不会被本次调用计数： 重复调用同一个 "
"``owner`` 第二次返回 0。"
msgstr ""
"Disabling only modifies an entry's ``enabled`` field (set to ``False``): the entry stays in "
"the container with its registration order unchanged, and a later ``enable_by_owner(owner)`` "
"restores it. Entries already disabled are unaffected and are not counted by this call: "
"repeating the call with the same ``owner`` returns 0 the second time."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.disable_by_owner:14 of
msgid ":meth:`enable_by_owner`、:meth:`remove_by_owner`"
msgstr ":meth:`enable_by_owner`, :meth:`remove_by_owner`"

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.enable_by_owner:1 of
msgid "把 ``by`` 与 ``owner`` 相等的全部停用条目恢复为启用。"
msgstr "Re-enable all disabled entries whose ``by`` equals ``owner``."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.enable_by_owner:9 of
msgid ""
"恢复只修改条目的 ``enabled`` 字段（置为 ``True``），不移动条目， "
"迭代顺序保持注册顺序。已处于启用状态的条目不受影响、也不会被 本次调用计数：重复调用同一个 ``owner`` 第二次返回 0。"
msgstr ""
"Restoration only modifies an entry's ``enabled`` field (set to ``True``) and never moves the "
"entry; the iteration order stays the registration order. Entries already enabled are "
"unaffected and are not counted by this call: repeating the call with the same ``owner`` "
"returns 0 the second time."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.enable_by_owner:13 of
msgid ":meth:`disable_by_owner`、:meth:`remove_by_owner`"
msgstr ":meth:`disable_by_owner`, :meth:`remove_by_owner`"

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_owner:1 of
msgid "把 ``by`` 与 ``owner`` 相等的全部条目从容器中彻底移除。"
msgstr "Permanently remove all entries whose ``by`` equals ``owner`` from the container."

#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_owner:9 of
msgid ""
"移除是彻底的：条目不再保留在容器中，之后无法经 ``enable_by_owner(owner)`` 恢复。移除对全部匹配条目生效，与条目 "
"当前是否停用无关；没有匹配条目时容器内容不变。"
msgstr ""
"Removal is permanent: the entries no longer stay in the container and cannot be restored "
"afterwards via ``enable_by_owner(owner)``. Removal applies to all matching entries regardless "
"of whether an entry is currently disabled; with no matching entries the container content is "
"unchanged."

#: flowing.context.PromptBlockList.enable_by_owner:15
#: flowing.context.PromptBlockList.remove_by_owner:28
#: flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_owner:13 of
msgid ":meth:`disable_by_owner`"
msgstr ":meth:`disable_by_owner`"
